ress hosting from the team that makes this plugin, tuned for speed and for sites in many languages.'=>'Marti-gelinta WordPress ee kooxda samaysay barnaamijkan dheeraadka ah, taas oo loo habeeyay xawaaraha iyo mareegaha ku baxa luqadaha badan.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Eeg martigelinta Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Kireyso khabiir ku takhasusay WordPress ee ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Goob suuq madax bannaan oo loogu talagalay naqshadaynta WordPress, horumarinta, turjumaadda iyo shaqada SEO.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Booqo ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Dejinta mareegaha iyo PBN-ka ee bulk-ga ah','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd waa madalkayaga lagu martigeliyo laguna maamulo bogag badan hal mar.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Booqo PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Soo hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro iyo Tranzly Pro wadajir','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Xirmaduhu waxay ku kacayaan xoogaa ka jaban intii lagu iibsan lahaa labada qalab (plugin) si gooni-gooni ah, iyadoo la raacayo qorshayaasha iyo xadka mareegaha ee isku midka ah.','See the bundle'=>'Fiiri xirmooyinka','Get %s'=>'Helo %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Isku-xirka waa uu shaqaynayaa: %1$s iyo %2$s wada jir ayaa loo adeegsadaa','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s ayaa ka dhex shaqaynaysa boggan, sidaas darteed labada tiagfureba waxay wadaagayaan hal konteenar oo fureyaal bixiyaha AI ah iyo hal shaashad oo dejinta iyaga ah.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ku turjun boggan adigoo isticmaalaya Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Bogagga si muuqaal ah ugu dhis Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, oo ka socota Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Daabac bog kasta oo ku qoran luqado badan, adoo adeegsanaya cinwaanno la turjumay, xogta SEO iyo beddelaha luqadda. Wuxuu la shaqeeyaa boggag aad halkan ku dhiseyso.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ku naqshadee bogagga si toos ah tifaftiraha iyadoo la adeegsanayo baloogyo degdeg ah oo aan lahayn raad raad. Wax kasta oo aad dhisato waxaa turjumaya Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s waxaa sameeyay isla kooxdaas waxayna si wada jir ah ula shaqaysaa furahan.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Markab ahaan ha ka oggolow in aad marka hore ku xirto boggan.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Geli iimayl sax ah.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Markab ahaan ha oggolaan in hore loo soo diro macluumaadka taageerada.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Qor mawduuc iyo fariin.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Geli ciwaan iimayl ah oo taageerada farsamadu ay ku soo jawaabi karto.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Dooro 1, 3 ama 7 maalmood.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Gelitaanka taageero ku-meel-gaar ah oo uu abuuray mulkiilaha boggu. Waxaa si toos ah loo tirtiraa marka ay dhacdo.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Kaliya maamulaha bogga, ee ku soo galay shaashaddan, ayaa abuuri kara gelitaanka taageerada ku-meelgaarka ah.','This site already has the most temporary support logins it can have at once. Revoke one below, or send the request without a login.'=>'Boggan wuxuu horey u leeyahay tirada ugu badan ee gelitaannada taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah ee uu hal mar yeelan karo. Ka noqo mid hoose, ama dir codsiga adigoon wadan gelitaan.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Magaca isticmaale ee gaarka ah lama dooran karo. Dib u day.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® (ku-me-gaar ah)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Gelitaankii taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ahayd waa ay dhacday.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyeyaasha ChatGPT. Qalab guud oo wanaagsan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Abuurayaasha Claude. Ku xooggan qorista iyo sababaynta taxaddarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Moodeellada Gemini ee Google. Waa kuwo dhakhso badan oo jaban.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad AI oo Yurub ah oo leh moodallo degdeg ah, jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Qaabab jaban oo ku fiican qorista iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal fure oo loogu talagalay moodooyinka bixiyeyaal badan oo kala duwan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida OpenAI\'s API, oo ay ku jirto qaab ay ku shaqeyneyso kombiyuutarkaaga ama adeegahaaga.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud ahaan (la isticmaalo marka aan wax gaar ah la cayimin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qorid iyo dib-u-qorid','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Code and CSS'=>'Code iyo CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looguma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Dejinnitan waxaa wadaaga dhammaan furayaasha adeegsada: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaaga waxaa lagu kaydiyaa xog-ururinta boggan waxaana loo diraa oo keliya bixiyaha aad dooratay — weligood annogu nama soo gaaraan.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Tallaabada 1 ee 2: dooro bixiye AI ah','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keenaysaa furahaaga gaarka ah, markaa waxaad si toos ah uga bixisaa bixiyaha wixii aad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Mid kasta oo ka mid ah kuwan ayaa si fiican u shaqeeya; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale markii dambe.','Next'=>'Kan xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeeggaaga OpenAI-waafaqsan, oo ku dhammaada /v1. Furaha waxa la rabaa oo keliya haddii adeeggu uu mid codsado.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fur %s oo lagalay (ama abuur akoon bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga furayaasha API ee %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Abuur fure cusub oona koobiyo.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Halkan ku dheji oo riix "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan dirноq codsi aad u yar si aan u hubino inuu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Int aksiiro ah ayaa inta badan u baahan xoogaa deyn ah oo ku jirta akoonka ka hor inta uusan fure shaqayn: %s.','add credit'=>'kordhi lacagta','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooq bixiye kale','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaha la kaydiyay wuxuu ku dhammaanayaa …%s — dhejiso mid cusub si aad u bedesho','Key (optional)'=>'Furaha (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Keydi oo tamiiti','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiyaha','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Furaha','Get a key'=>'Hel furaha','Test'=>'Tijaabi','Remove'=>'Ka tirtir','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Nooca cusub ee qalab-kordhinta ayaa keydiyay: cusboonaysii qalab-kordhintakan, ama mar labaad gelifuraha.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay hadda lama furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Geli mar kale.','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ku xiran — imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu guuleystay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu fashilmay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xidhan — wali lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Waa maxay moodeelka la isticmaalayo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay calaamad u tahay taladayada hawshaas. Liisku waxa uu ka kooban yahay moodel kasta oo ay furahaagu isticmaali karo, oo si toos ah looga akhriyay adeeg-bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Waxaa lagula talinayaa bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Keydso moodellada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ka cusboonaysii liiska noocyada bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirrada','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xir OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawiro u samayso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Goobta raadinta (ku-tallaalidda)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u dhisto tusmada raadinta ee mareegahaaga.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka laba-gelinta ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Beddelidda tani waxay dib u dhisaysaa tusmada raadinta ee kasta oo ah plugin-ka isticmaala.','best quality'=>'tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'qiimaha ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'ugu dhaqso badan','Add a model yourself'=>'Sidaada ugu dar moodel','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Maanta ma nooc cusub soo baxay? Geli magaciisa saxda ah si aad si toos ah u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca moodelka','Add model'=>'Ku dar qaabka','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska moodellada lagu taliyay','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska moodallada lagu taliyay lama xaqiijin karo, markaa wax talo ah lama soo bandhigayo. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin-ka), ama shid casriyeynta maalinlaha ah ee hoose.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liistada la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusboonaysiin kasta oo plugin ah waxay keentaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale hubi Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii si aad u hesho liis la cusboonaysiiyay.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi soo dejin oo fudud ayaa la dirayaa: ma jiro furaha, ciwaanka goobta, wax ku saabsan nuxurkaaga. Liiska waa la saxiixay, liiska ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixa waa la iska indhatirayaa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, oo hadda hubi haddii la shiday','a newer list was installed'=>'liis cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'horay ayuu u cusboonaaday','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'soo dejintu waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta saxiixa waxaana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karo; liiska hadda jira waa la isticmaalayaa','turned off'=>'damchay','Open'=>'Furo','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggoodooda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga biilasha','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogtaada furayaasha API-ga','Open the AI settings'=>'Furo goobaha AI-ga','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looma oggola inaad taas sameyso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la aqoon.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli ciwaanka adeeggaaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Nuqul ka yeeg mar kale, adiga oo aan wadata meelo bannaan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Horta geli furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa la saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Qaababka waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca sax ah ee moodeelka, tusaale ahaan sida dukumentiyada bixiyaha ay u qoraan.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'La daray %s. Ka dooro hoosta "Nooca la isticmaalayo".','Model removed.'=>'Qaabka la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusboonaysiinada maalinlaha ah waa damtisay. Liiska la socday qalabka dheeriga ah ayaa la isticmaalayaa.','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyay: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodalka waa la cusboonaysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furehaydaada AI waxaa kaydiyay nooc ka cusub mid ka mid ah fiilooyinkaaga. Cusboonaysii fiiladan, ama geli furaha mar labaad oo ah goobaha AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Fureyaga AI ee la kaydiyay lama furan karo mar dambe (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Geli mar labaad goobaha AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI lama dejinin weligiis. Ku dar furaha bixiyaha AI dejinta AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hawushan lama dooran wax nooc ah. Dooro mid ka mid ah dejinta AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gaas laguma taageero noocaan ah ee qalab-kordhinta.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro wax bixiyaha AI ah oo sawirro samayn kara oo ku xidhan. Ku dar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini dejinta AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gan ma sameyn karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ku jira dejinta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooca sawirka ah. Hubi ogolaanshaha furaha ee bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo sawirrada ah.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro bixiye AI ah oo ku xiran oo dhis kara tusmada raadinta. Ku dar fure Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter ah goobaha AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo nooc kasta oo embedding ah. Hubi ogolaanshaha furaha ee bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo loogu talagalay raadinta bogga.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bixiyahan AI ma dhisi karo tusmo raadin. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama adeeg ku habboon raadinta goobta.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Boggan ma gaari karo adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqaynayo iyo in ciwaankiisa laga soo gaari karo server-kaaga shabakadda (adeeg ka dhex jira kombuyuutarkaaga lagama soo gaari karo bog la martigeliyay).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Boggani ma gaari karo %s. Hubi boggooda xaaladda; haddii ay shaqeynayaan, waxaa laga yaabaa in martigeliyahaagu uu xirayo xiriirada ka baxaya, ama ciwaanku waa khalad.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s waxa uu sheegayaa in koontadaadu ay ka dhammaatay credit ama quota. Ku dar credit ama kor u qaad xadkaaga koontadaada iyaga, kadibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s ma aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baabi\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Samee fure cusub oo halkan ku dhaji.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday codsigan furahaaga. Furaha waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan marin u helin qaabkan ama muuqaalkan, ama akoonkaaga ayaa u baahan in la xaqiijiyo.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Qaabka "%1$s" waxaa laga helin %2$s furehaaga. Dooro qaab kale oo ka tirsan dejinta AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro tusaalaha "%1$s". Dooro tusaale kale oo ku jira dejinta AI, ama ku cusboonaysii qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s waxay xaddidaysaa inta ay xawaarahaagu key-gaaga ku soo diri karto codsiyada. Sug hal daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day, ama kor u qaad xadkaaga sicirka iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s wax dhibaato ah ayaa haysata hadda (cillad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah dhankooda ah). Dejintaada wax khalad ah kama jiraan. Mar kale isku day dhawaan.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab uusan ku shaqeyn karin ama uusan akhrin karin furahan (plugin). Mar kale isku day; haddii ay dhacdo mar walba, dooro nooc kale ama la xiriir taageerada.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Custom (OpenAI-compatible)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Markabkan furaha u keydi bixiyahakan marka hore.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furahaagu wuu shaqeynayaa, laakiin bixiyaha ma liis gareynayo nooc qoraal ah (text model) oo loogu talagalay. Ku dar nooc adiga laftaadu hoos ku qoran.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ku xidhan. %1$s waxa uu ku jawaabay adigoo isticmaalaya %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waa diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Dooxada isticmaalahaagu uma oggola in ay ka faa\'iidaysato AI boggan. Weydii maamule.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Webkaan wuxuu gaadhay xadka uu bishii ku bixin lahaa kharashka AI-ga. Maamulaha ayaa kor u qaadi kara habaynta AI-ga.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggan wuxuu gaadhay xadka uu bishii isticmaali jiray ee codsiyada AI. Maamulaha ayaa kordhin kara goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo kharashka','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xadka iyo ogolaanshaha doorka waxaa lagu dabaqaa sirdoonka macmalka (AI) ee lagu isticmaalo iyada oo loo marayo: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kharashyada waa kuwo qiyaas ah, oo laga soo saaray qiimayaasha la daabacay; qaab aan la aqoon qiimihiisa waxaa loo tiriyaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsiyo, ku dhawaad %2$s.','When'=>'Goorma','Who'=>'Yaa','Used for'=>'Loo isticmaalay','Model'=>'Qaabka','Tokens in / out'=>'Calaamadaha gudaha / dibadda','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli lama samayn codsiyo AI ah.','Done'=>'La dhammeeyey','Limits and permissions'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bisha (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'U dhaaf madhan xadka la\'aan. AI waxay istaagaysaa inta ka dhiman bisha marka qiimaha qiyaasaha ahi uu gaaro.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiga bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'U dhaaf bannaan xad la\'aan.','Who may use AI'=>'Yaa isticmaali kara AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Calaamadi midna si aadl u oggolaato qof kasta oo isticmaali kara sifooyinka plugin-ka inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu waxay isticmaali karaan mar walba.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Kaydi xaddidyada iyo fasaxyada','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha waa la keydiyay.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Khalad xagga amniga ah, fadlan dib u cusboonaysii bogga oona isku day mar kale.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Warka wargelinlaha waa maqan yahay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Dejinta wargeyska waa mid aan sax ahayn. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid email address.'=>'Ciwaanka email-ka waa mid aan ansaxeyn.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Fadlan calaamadi sanduuqa si aad ugu heshiiso ka hor inta aanad is-diiwaangelin.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Isku dayo aad u badan. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado kooban kadib.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wax qalad ah ayaa dhacay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Map'=>'Khariirad','Background video'=>'Muuqaalka asalka ah','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d faylalka farta la keydiyey, xaashida qaab-dhismeedka %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Qoyskaasi lama kaydiyo.','Removed.'=>'Waa la saaray.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Taasi ma aha magac qoys far sax ah.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts ma soo celinin qoyskaas. Hubi magaca oo dib u day.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylasha farta lama soo dejisan karo ama lama keydin karo. Hubi in galka soo-gelinta la qori karo.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Qoraalka farta ee stylesheet-ka lama keydin karin. Hubi in galka soo-gelinta la qori karo.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Ka takhal ogeysiintaan','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Done:'=>'La dhammeeyay:','To do:'=>'Luuq:','Glossary index'=>'Tusaha erayada','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'%2$s ka mid ah %1$s ayaa la qiimeeyay','Progress'=>'Horumarinta','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Nuugi koodka','Copied'=>'La nuquleeyay','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Widget-kaas looma heli karo boggan.','Email'=>'Email','Phone'=>'Telefoon','RSS feed'=>'Kulanka RSS','Website'=>'Shabakad','Link'=>'Isku xir','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (ayaa ku furmaya tab cusub)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'Qiimeysay %d oo ah 5','(recommended)'=>'(lagula talinayo)','Included'=>'Ku jira','Not included'=>'Lama dareersan','Comparison table'=>'Tusmada isbarbardhiga','Call %s'=>'Wac %s','Email %s'=>'Email %s','Text %s'=>'Qoraal %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Ku sheekayso WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Nala soo xiriir','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Kala hadaaq WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Foomkani ma heli karo hadda.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Foomkan lama soo bandhigi karo sababtoo ah %s ma shaqeynayo.','Map: %s'=>'Khariiradda: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Muujinta khariidadda waxay ka soo dejineysaa OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Muuji khariidadda','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Fur khariidadda OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kalandarka ballanta ee ka yimid %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Muujinta jadwalka ballamuhu waxay ka soo dejineysaa %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Muuji jadwalka ballamaha','Book on %s'=>'Boog ka qor %s','QR code for %s'=>'Koodka QR ee %s','Design'=>'Naqshadaynta','Content'=>'Muxuu ku jiraa','Media'=>'Warbaahin','Marketing'=>'Suuqgeyn','Site'=>'Goobta','Data'=>'Xogta','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Affiliate & iGaming','Related posts'=>'Qoraallada la xiriira','Post details'=>'Faahfaahinta qoraalka','By'=>'Waxaa qoray','Published'=>'La daabacay','Updated'=>'La cusboonaysiiyay','In'=>'Gudaha','Tagged'=>'Calaamadeeyay','%d minute read'=>'%d daqiiqo oo akhris ah' . "\0" . '%d daqiiqadood oo akhris ah','No comments yet'=>'Faallooyin weli ma jiraan','%d comment'=>'%d faallo' . "\0" . '%d faallooyin','Sitemap'=>'Khariidadda Shabakadda','(no title)'=>'(Cinwaan la\'aan)','All posts by %s'=>'Dhammaan qoraallada uu qoray %s','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Waxkan waa mid la ilaalinayo. Geli erayga sirta ah si aad u aragto.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Furahaas sirta ah sax ma aha. Mar labaad isku day.','Password'=>'Furaha sirta ah','Show the content'=>'Muuji waxyaabaha ku jira','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Boggaas lama fureri karo.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Isku-dayo aad u badan. Sug daqiiqado oo dib u dayo.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Furaha sirta ah waa inay noqotaa int u dhaxaysa 4 iyo 200 xaraf.','More'=>'In ka badan','Close'=>'Xidh','Tab %d'=>'Tabka %d','Contents'=>'Muxuu ka kooban yahay','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Qoraallada shaashadda maamulaha ayaa ka maqan nuqulkan barnaamijka dheeriga ah (plugin). Dib uga rakib xirmo la sii daayay.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Shaarkani wuxuu u baahan yahay JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Luuqadaha','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Macaamiisha martigelinta? Hel %1$d%% dhimis ah %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Adeegga martigelinta ee Zinn Digital® ahaan, waxaad helaysaa koodh shaqsiyeed oo ah %d%% dhimis ah bixintaada ugu horreysa. Cusboonaysiinta waxaa lagu sameeyaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Helo %d%% koodkayga oo tag bixinta','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Sicir-dhimistan waxaa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelin lacag ah oo xaaladdisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ah uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Horay baad u isticmaashay qiimo-dhimistaada martigeliyaha ee plugin-kan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hadda ma aan helin code-kaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado gudahood.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a 