rce, children arrangements and financial settlements.'=>'Furriinka, qorshaynta carruurta iyo dejinta maaliyadeed.','Employment'=>'Shaqo','Advice for employers and employees, from contracts to tribunals.'=>'Talooyinka loo jeediyo loo-shaqeeyayaasha iyo shaqaalaha, laga bilaabo qandaraasyada illaa maxkamadaha.','Wills and probate'=>'Dardaaran iyo dhaxal','Wills, lasting powers of attorney and estate administration.'=>'Dardaarannada, awoodaha qareenka ee waqtiga dheer iyo maamulka hantida.','Dispute resolution'=>'Xallinta muranka','Negotiation, mediation and litigation when it is needed.'=>'Gorgortan, heshiisiin iyo dacwad marka loo baahdo.','Local Plumber'=>'Tuubbada maxalliga ah','Need a plumber today?'=>'Ma u baahan tahay tuubo-yahayn maanta?','Call now or book online. Emergency slots available around the clock.'=>'Hadda wac ama ballan ka qabso internetka. Boosaska xaaladaha degdegga ah waa la heli karaa saacad kasta.','Book a visit'=>'Buugso booqasho','Do you charge a call-out fee?'=>'Ma qaadaysaa lacagta wicitaanka?','Our fixed price includes the visit. You will know the cost before we start.'=>'Qiimaha go\'an ee aanu soo bandhignay waxaa ku jira booqashada. Waad ogaan doontaa kharashka ka hor inta aanan bilaabin.','Which areas do you cover?'=>'Waa kuwee meelaha aad daboolaysaa?','The whole town and every village within 20 miles.'=>'Magaalada oo dhan iyo tuulo kasta oo ku dhex taal 20 mayl.','Are you insured?'=>'Ma caymisantahay?','Yes, fully insured, and every job has a 12-month guarantee.'=>'Haa, caymis buuxa ayaa leh, shaqo kastaana waxay leedahay dammaanad 12-bilood ah.','24/7 emergency service'=>'Adeeg degdeg ah oo 24/7 ah','Fast, friendly plumbing. Fixed right the first time.'=>'Biin-biyood degdeg ah, saaxiibtinimo leh. Si sax ah ayaa loo hagaajiyay markii ugu horreysay.','Leaks, blocked drains, boilers and bathrooms. Local, insured engineers with upfront prices and a 12-month guarantee on our work.'=>'Daadadka, tuubooyinka xiran, kululeeyeyaasha iyo musqulaha. Injineerro deegaanka ah, oo caymis leh oo leh qiimo hore iyo damaanad 12-bilood ah oo ku saabsan shaqadayada.','Emergency call-out'=>'Wicitaanka degdegga ah','Why homeowners choose us'=>'Sababta milkiilayaasha guryuhu ay noogu doorteen','Arrival slots you can plan around'=>'Waqtiyada imaanshaha ee aad qorshayn karto','Price agreed before we start'=>'Qiimaha waa la isla gartay intaanan bilaabin','Clean, tidy and insured'=>'Nadiif ah, habaysan oo caymis leh','12-month workmanship guarantee'=>'Dammaanadda shaqada ee 12-ka bilood','What we fix'=>'Waxa aan hagaajinno','From a dripping tap to a full bathroom, one call covers it.'=>'Laga soo bilaabo tuubbo dhibcaysa ilaa musqul buuxda, hal wicitaan ayaa daboolaya.','Emergency repairs'=>'Dayactirka deg-degga ah','Burst pipes, leaks and no water, day or night.'=>'Tuubooyinka qarxa, daadashada iyo biyaha oo la waayo, maalin ama habeen.','Boilers and heating'=>'Kuleyliyeyaasha ва kuleylinta','Servicing, repairs and new boiler installs.'=>'Adeegaynta, dayactirka iyo rakibidda kululeeyaha cusub.','Blocked drains'=>'Dhuumaha xiran','Sinks, toilets and outside drains cleared fast.'=>'Musqulaha, musqulaha suuliga iyo biyo-mareennada dibadda waxaa la nadiifiyaa si degdeg ah.','Bathrooms'=>'Musqulaha','Design, fitting and tiling, managed start to finish.'=>'Naqshadaynta, rakibidda iyo dabar-saarka, kuwaas oo laga maamulo bilow ilaa dhammaad.','Leak detection'=>'Ogaanshaha daadinta','Hidden leaks found without tearing up the house.'=>'Daadadinta qarsan ee la helay iyada oo guriga la burburin.','Landlord checks'=>'Hubinta mulkiilaha','Safety certificates and planned maintenance.'=>'Shahaadooyinka badbaadada iyo dayactirka qorsheysan.','Came within the hour on a Sunday and fixed the leak. Brilliant.'=>'Axaddii waxay yimaadeen saacad gudaheed waxayna hagaajiyeen dillaaca. Waa mid cajiib ah.','Helen M.'=>'Helen M.','Homeowner'=>'Mulkiilaha guryaha','Fair price, explained everything, left the bathroom spotless.'=>'Qiimo macquul ah, wax walba wuu sharaxay, musqushana si nadiif ah ayuu uga tegay.','Tom R.'=>'Tom R.','We use them for all our rental properties. Always reliable.'=>'Waxaan u adeegsannaa dhammaan hantidayada kiro ah. Had iyo jeer waa la isku halayn karaa.','Aisha K.'=>'Aisha K.','Landlord'=>'Mulkiilaha guryaha','Online Academy'=>'Akadeemiyada Khadka Tooska ah','Enrolment open'=>'Isku-qoriddu waa furan tahay','Learn new skills at your own pace'=>'Baro xirfado cusub adoo qaadanaya xawaarahaaga','Practical online courses taught by working professionals. Learn in short lessons, practise with real projects and earn a certificate.'=>'Koorsooyin online ah oo wax ku ool ah oo ay bixiyaan xirfadlayaal shaqeeya. Ku baro casharro kooban, ku tababaro mashaariic dhab ah oo hel shahaado.','Browse courses'=>'Koorsooyinka baadh','Every course includes'=>'Koorsasta kasta waxaa ku jira','Short video lessons'=>'Casharro muuqaal gaaban ah','Real-world projects'=>'Mashruucyada dunida dhabta ah','Mentor feedback'=>'Jawaabta tababaraha','Certificate on completion'=>'Shahaadada dhammaystirka','Popular courses'=>'Koorsooyinka caanka ah','Web development'=>'Horumarinta mareegaha','HTML, CSS and JavaScript from first principles to projects.'=>'HTML, CSS, iyo JavaScript laga bilaabo mabaadi\'da koowaad ilaa mashaariicda.','Digital marketing'=>'Suuqgeynta dhijitaalka ah','SEO, content, email and social campaigns that work.'=>'Olololeynta SEO, nuxurka, iimaylka iyo warbaahinta bulshada ee shaqeeya.','Data analysis'=>'Falanqaynta xogta','Spreadsheets, SQL and dashboards for better decisions.'=>'Warqadaha faafinta (Spreadsheets), SQL iyo dashboodhyada go\'aanno ka wanaagsan.','UX design'=>'Naqshadeynta UX','Research, wireframes and prototypes users love.'=>'Cilmibaaris, naqshadaha hore (wireframes) iyo noocyada tijaabada ah ee isticmaaleyaashu jecel yihiin.','Project management'=>'Maamulka mashruuca','Plan, deliver and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Qorshee, hirgeli oona ku hoggaami mashaariicda kalsooni.','Business writing'=>'Qorista ganacsiga','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Iibso iimillada, warbixinnada, iyo soo-jeedimaha.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Goobaha Niche Authority','Start here'=>'Ka billow halkaan','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'Mowduucyada ay akhristayaashu inta badan wax ka weydiiyaan.','Growing vegetables'=>'Khudaarta oo la beero','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Sariiraha la kor qaaday, carada, jadwalka abuurka iyo goosashada.','Lawn care'=>'Daryeelka cawska','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Quudinta, jarista iyo hagaajinta cawska dhibco-dhibcaha leh.','Garden tools'=>'Qalabka Beerta','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Waxa mudan in la iibsado iyo sida loo daryeesho.','Small gardens'=>'Beero yaryar','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Balcony, patio iyo weelal.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Hagayaasha wax-ku-oolka ah ee beero-korinta guriga','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Talooyin toosan oo ku saabsan korinta khudaarta, daryeelidda cawska iyo doorashada qalabka saxda ah, oo ay qoreen dadka beerta ka shaqeeya dhammaadka usbuuc kasta.','Read the latest guides'=>'Akhriso hageyaasha ugu dambeeyay','About the author'=>'Ku saabsan qoraaga','Estate Agency'=>'Wakaaladda Guryaha','What is your home worth?'=>'Waa maxay qiimaha gurigaagu?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Ballanso qiimeyn lacag la\'aan ah oo aan waajib ahayn.','Book a valuation'=>'Codsog qiimayn','Free valuation'=>'Qiimayn lacag la\'aan ah','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wakiil ayaa soo booqanaya isla markaana qiimeynaya gurigaaga.','Launch'=>'Daahfur','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Sawirrada, qorshaha dabaqa iyo liiska waxaa la daabacaa maalmo gudahood.','Sold'=>'Iibiyey','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Waxaan ka wada xaajooneynaa oo aan maamuleynaa iibinta ilaa laga gaarayo dhammaadka.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Furan Talaadada ilaa Axadda','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Cuntada xilliga, ee loo sameeyay in la wadaago','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Khudradda maxalliga ah, foornada alwaaxa ku shaqaysa iyo liiska khamriga ee ay doorteen dadka jecel. Qadada iyo cashada, lix maalmood todobaadkii.','Book a table'=>'Qabsado miiska','See the menu'=>'Fiiri liiska xulashada','From our kitchen'=>'Jikadayada','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Liis gaaban oo isbedbeddela xilliyada sanadka. Nagala soo xiriir xasaasiyadda: waanu ku faraxnay inaanu la qabsanno.','Small plates'=>'Sahan yar','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Keegag fidsan ee la dubay, hilib la qalajiyey iyo khudaarta beerta si loo bilaabo.','From the fire'=>'Dabka ka timid','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Kalluun dhan, hilib la bisleeyey iyo khudaar foornada alwaaxa lagu dubay.','Fresh pasta'=>'Baastada cusub','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Maalin kasta gacanta ayaa lagu sameeyaa, waxaana lagu bixiyaa suugo xilliyeed.','Desserts'=>'Cuntooyinka Macaan','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Tart-yada, ayasyada iyo boorinka jiiska oo laga helay samayayasha hoose.','Set lunch'=>'U qoondee qadada','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Laba ama saddex koorsooyin oo qiimo go\'an ah, Talaadada ilaa Jimcaha.','Private dining'=>'Quraac gaar ah','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Qol gaar ah oo loogu talagalay ilaa 18 marti ah oo leh menu gaar ah loogu talagalay.','SaaS Product'=>'Alaabta SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Ma jiraa qorshe bilaash ah?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Haa, waa bilaash kooxaha yaryar, qorshe kasta oo la bixiyana wuxuu ka billowdaa tijaabo 14-cisho ah.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Ma joojin karaa wakhti kasta?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Haa. Qorshayaasha billaha ah waa la joojin karaa wakhti kasta.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Xogtaydu xaggee bay ku kaydsan tahay?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'Xarumaha xogta ee sugan, oo la sireeyay, iyadoo keydin maalinle ah la sameeyo.','Everything your team needs'=>'Wax kasta oo kooxdaadu u baahan tahay','Boards and timelines'=>'Looxyada iyo jadwalka wakhtiga','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'U beddelka inta u dhexeysa looxa kanban iyo jadwalka hal gujin.','Automations'=>'Otomaatiqyada','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'U guur hawsha, u magacow mulkiilayaal oo si toos ah u dir xusuusinta.','Shared files'=>'Faylasha la wadaago','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Dokumentiyada ku hay agagaarka shaqada ay ka tirsan yihiin.','Reports'=>'Warbixinaha','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Dashboard-yada tooska ah ee culayska shaqada, horumarka iyo waqtiyada kama dambaysta ah.','Integrations'=>'Isku-dhafka','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Isku xir iimaylka, wada-sheekaysiga iyo qalabka kaydinta ee aad hore u isticmaashay.','Security'=>'Amniga','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Soo-galitaanka keliya, diiwaannada xisaab-xidhka iyo xogta la sireeyey.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Tijaabo bilaash ah oo ah 14 maalmood, kaarka looma baahna','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Qorshee mashaariic, ee ha ahaato xaashiyaha xisaabta','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Hal meel-shaqo oo loogu talagalay hawlaha, waqti-qabsoomayaasha iyo faylasha. Kooxdaadu waxay aragtaa waxa muhiimka ah maanta, adiguna waxaad aragtaa horumarka adiga oo aan codsan warbixinno cusub.','Start free trial'=>'Bilow tijaabada bilaashka ah','See features'=>'Eeg sifooyinka','Up and running in minutes'=>'Daah-fur oo shaqaynaya daqiiqado gudahood','Create a workspace'=>'Abuur meel-shaqo','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Isdiiwaangeli oo ku casuun kooxdaada daqiiqado gudahood.','Import your work'=>'Sooji shaqadaada','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Hawsha ka soo geli xaashiyaha xisaabta ama qalab kale.','Get moving'=>'Bilow socodka','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Andakadaha iyo otomaatiggu waxay qabtaan shaqada mashquulka ah.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Looma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho shaygan.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Tan ma aha mid la ogol yahay inaad samayso.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Qaabka ammaanada waa la damiyay maxaa yeelay mar dambe ma waafaqsana gelitaankaaga. Dib u soo deji bogga.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Waxa habka nabdoon isticmaali kara oo keliya maamule.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Habka badbaadada leh wuxuu u baahan yahay galitaanka biraawsarka caadiga ah.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Habka badbaadada lama dejin karo.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka badbaadada wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaansho qoraal ah oo loo helo galka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka badbaadada ayaa ku guuldareystay inuu wax ku qoro galka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Boggaasi ma jiro, ama waa la tirtiray.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio waxay la shaqaysaa tifaftiraha baloogga, tifaftiraha baloogguna waa dansan yahay shaygan. Galka sida Classic Editor ayaa sidaas yeela: u oggolow tifaftiraha baloogga shaygan dejintiisa (Dejinta → Qorista), dabadeedna mar kale fur Sandwich Studio.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looguma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho shaygan Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio lama dhisin. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin).','Add title'=>'Ku dar cinwaan','Type / to choose a block'=>'Geli / si aad u doorato baloog','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Loading Sandwich Studio waa la soo dejinayaa…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio waxay u baahan tahay JavaScript. Isticmaal tifaftiraha caadiga ah beddelkeeda.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ka beddel “%s” adigoo wata Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku tiri Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Shiraarka madhan','Skip to content'=>'U gudub waxa ku jira','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Ballaca kiniinka waa inay noqotaa tiro buuxda oo ah pixels laga bilaabo 480 ilaa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Ballaca mobilku waa inay ahaataa tiro dhan oo pixels ah, ugu yaraan 240 kana yar ballaca tablet-ka.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Joogsi kasta oo caado ah wuxuu u baahan yahay aqoonsi u gaar ah: 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yar yar ama nambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Barta jabaadka ee gaarka ah waxaa la adeegsadaa ilaa ballac (200 ilaa 4000 pixels) ama laga bilaabo ballac (200 ilaa 6000 pixels), ee maaha labadaba.','Tablet'=>'Kaniini','Mobile'=>'Mobilka','Site design'=>'Naqshada goobta','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Midabada, farqadaha iyo qaababka ay wadaagaan bog kasta oo ka mid ah mareegaha iyo mawduucaaga.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka caalamiga ah ee bogga lama furi karin.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Font-kaasi ma aha mid ka mid ah font-yada mareegta.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Midab kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfaha yar yar, nambarada iyo xariiqmaha dhexe.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Midabka "%s" ma aha midab CSS ah oo sax ah.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Fararım kasta waa inay yeelataa magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfaha yar yar, nambarka, iyo xariijimaha (hyphens).','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Font stack-ga "%s" waxa ku jiri kara kaliya magacyada font-ka, xigashooyinka, komooyinka iyo meelaha bannaan.','Uploaded icons'=>'Summersii la soo geliyay','Icon'=>'Icon','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Falkan ma aha astaamo SVG ah oo aan isticmaali karno. Wuxuu noqon karaa mid wax yeeleeyay, ama wuxuu wataa kaliya nuxur laga saaray sababo ammaan awgood (qoraallo, xiriiriyeyaal, sawirro ama farta qoraalka ah ee ku dhex jira).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Astaantu lama tirtiri karo.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha ruqhadda','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale weli lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah ka hortagga hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu abuurto isticmaalahaaga, waxaad ogolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca buuxa ee isticmaalaha WordPress iyo cinwaanka iimaylka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha la soo sheegay','Account'=>'Koontada','Account Details'=>'Xogta Akoonka','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugeysaa in la hawlgeliyo. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xiriiriyaha si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka wakiilka.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Tallaabooyinka','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Activate Free Version'=>'Dhaqaaji Nooca Lacag-La\'aanta ah','Activate License'=>'Dhaqaaji Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'haysiis shaqaynaysa ka fur halkan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla markiiba ka dib iibsashada:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan bogagga shabakadda.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kharash gareey shaqada shatiga goobaha oo dhan ee sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Noocyada lacagta ah ee %1$s horay ayaa loo rakibay. Fadlan hawlgeli si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga sifooyinka %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u dhaqaajiso oo aad uga bilow faa\'iidada sifooyinka %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Firqo kan howlgeli','Activate %s'=>'Kici %s','Activate %s features'=>'Hawl geli sifooyinka %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation 