 jiidayo adeegsiye dibadda ah.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Dheeraadyada module %s','Address Line %d'=>'Cinwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Wakaaladda Xiriirinta','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sababtoo ah xadgudubka shuruudahayaga xiriirinta, waxaan go\'aansanay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xirno akoonkaaga xiriirinta. Haddii aad qabtid wax su\'aalo ah, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka waxaa la joojiyay si KMG ah.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsashadaada xiriiriyaha ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Soo gal xarumahaaga xiriiriyaha adigoo isticmaalaya: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waan ku mahadcelineynaa codsigaaga barnaamijka shuraakada, nasiib darro, waxaan go\'aansannay inaan diidno codsigaaga wakhtigan. Fadlan isku day mar labaad 30 maalmood gudahood.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad codsatay barnaamijkayaga xiriirinta, waxaan eegi doonaa maahfaahintaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socda oo waxaan dib ugula soo xiriiri doonaa macluumaad dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kuki-ga raadraaca booqashada kowaad ka dib si loo kordhiyo dakhliga suurtagalka ah.','Affiliation'=>'Xiriirinta','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Markuu ruqsaddaadu dhaco waxaad weli isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin MA HELAYSID sifooyinka %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Marka shatigaagu dhaco, endhici lamahaan doontid inaad isticmaasho %s, ilaa aad dib uga hawlgeliso shati qiimo leh oo sax ah.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan sifooyinka %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid amniga %2$s & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, mana helaysid taageero.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Mahadsanid casriyeynta.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Ka dib %1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah, bixi wax aan badnayn %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Ogow oo Dhaqaaji Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Ku Heshiiyay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Dhammaan Codsiyada','All Types'=>'Noocyada oo dhan','allow'=>'ogolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Horay ayaad uga qaybgashey la socodka isticmaalkayaga, kaas oo gacan ka geysta inaan sii wadno horumarinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Horay ayaad uga mid noqotay la socodka isticmaalkeena, kaas oo gacan ka geysta inaan sii wadno hagaajintooda.','Amount'=>'Cadadka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sanadle','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sanadle','Anonymous feedback'=>'Jawaabcelinta qarsoodiga ah','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Codso dhammaan mareegaha la sugayo.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codso inaad noqoto xubin la xiriirta','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Oggolow oo Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noogu sheeg sababta si aan u horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimeylka ee aad u isticmaashay kor-u-qaadista hoose waxaana dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Enter the 