aacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa milkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Waad ku mahadsantahay xaqiijinta beddelka mulkiyadda. Email ayaa hadda loo diray %s si uu u ansixiyo dhammaadka ah.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Milkiyadda','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Bedel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Adigoo beddelaya isticmaalaha, waxaad ogolaanaysaa inaad u wareejiso la-wareegidda akoonka:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Taariikhda wax-ka-beddelka','Changing user, please wait'=>'Bedelida isticmaalaha, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam ama raadi iimaylleyda ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Bixinta xisaabta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s goob(bo) si aad shatiga ugu dhaqaajiso.','City'=>'Magaalada','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Kaydka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Nadiifi Cusbooneysiinta Ku-meel-gaarka ah','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Halkan riix si aad plugin-ka u isticmaasho adigoo anaan kaaga aqoonin','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto faallooyinka bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa ciwaanka iimaylka macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Koodh','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s gunnada ah marka uu macaamiil iibsado shati cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maaddaama aanu 30 maalmood u kaydinno lacag-celinta suurtagalka ah, waxaan bixinnaa oo keliya guddiyada ka da\'weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Isgaarsiinta','Compatible up to'=>'La j