etected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray hawsha cusboonaysiinta waxaanu shabakadda ka dhex ogaanay %s goob(bo) oo weli u baahan in aad fiiro gaar ah u yeelato.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Inta lagu jiro howsha cusboonaysiinta waxaan ogaanay %d mareeg(yo) oo weli sugaya hawlgelinta shatiga.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho %s ee bogaggaas, fadlan geli furahaaga ruqsadaha hoose oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad iska dhaafi kartaa hadda oo aad shatiga hawlgelin kartaa hadhow, bogga Account ee %s ee heerka shabakadda.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xidhan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Marka aad dhammaysato, dami %s oo dib u daari.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan noo soo sheeg haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inay nagu soo xiriiraan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarka ah:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xumahay dhibaatada soo gaartay, waana joognaa si aan ku caawino haddii aad na siiso fursad.','Contact Us'=>'Nala Xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir halkan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka-qaybgalayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama howlgelin karo %s.','Country'=>'Waddanka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the A