ges & regions the plugin should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Macluumaadka ogaanshaha cilladaha oo lala wadaago %s waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin ku habboon shabakaddaada, ka fogaanshaha WordPress ama noocyada PHP ee aan la jaanqaadi karin kuwaas oo jebin kara shabakaddaada, iyo aqoonsashada luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in blugan loo turjumo laguna habeeyo.','Sharing your name and email allows us to keep you in the loop about new features and important updates, warn you about security issues before they become public knowledge, and send you special offers.'=>'Magacaaga iyo iimaylkaaga oo aad la wadaagto waxay noo ogolaanaysaa inaan kugula socodsiino sifooyinka cusub iyo cusboonaysiinta muhiimka ah,aan kaaga digino arrimaha amniga ka hor intaanay noqonin aqoonta dadweynaha, iyo inaan kuu dirno dalabyo gaar ah.','Diagnostic data will no longer be sent from %1$s to %2$s.'=>'Xogta cilmi-baarista laguma diri doono %1$s laga bilaabo %2$s.','Opt in to make "%s" better!'=>'Isdiiwaangeli si aad uga dhigtid "%s" mid ka fiican!','Opting in'=>'Waqtiga diiwaangelinta','Opting out'=>'Ka bixitaanka','For ongoing compatibility with your website, you can optionally allow %s to:'=>'Si loo hubiyo in mareegtaadu ay sii waddo la jaanqaadkeeda, waxaad si ikhtiyaari ah ugu oggolaan kartaa %s inuu:','Other'=>'Ku darraan','Plugin installer section titleOther Notes'=>'Qoraalada Kale','Owner Email'=>'Iibsaha Iimaylka','Owner ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Mulkiilaha','Owner Name'=>'Magaca Mulkiilaha','Paid add-on must be deployed to Freemius.'=>'Ku-daridda la bixiyo waa in la geeyaa Freemius.','as file/folder pathPath'=>'Waddo','Payments'=>'Lacagaha la bixiyay','Payouts are in USD and processed monthly via PayPal.'=>'Bixinta waxaa lagu bixiyaa USD waxaana la habeeyaa bishii hal mar iyada oo la marinayo PayPal.','PayPal account email address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka ee koontada PayPal','PayPal email address is required.'=>'Waa waajib in la geliyo cinwaanka iimaylka ee PayPal.','PCI compliant'=>