 isticmaashay.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Sidee u jeceshahay %1$s ilaa iyo hadda? Tijaabi dhammaan sifooyinka %2$s ee qaaliga ah adiga oo isticmaalaya %3$d maalmood oo tijaabo ah oo bilaash ah.','Type'=>'Nooca','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Lama xiriiri karo nidaamka faylalka. Fadlan xaqiiji aqoonsigaaga.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Waxaa jiray khalad API ah oo lama filaan ah intii lagu guda jiray ka shaqaynta codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado gudahood haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, kala xidhiidh qoraaga %s waxyaabaha soo socda:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Cilad aan la fileyn, fadlan 5 daqiiqo dib u day. Haddii ciladdu ay sii jirto, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Uninstall-gareynta %s waxay si otomaatig ah u joojin doontaa ruqsadda, taas oo aad awood u yeelan doontaa inaad ka isticmaasho goob kale.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Waxaa dhacay qalad aan la aqoon.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Komishanada aan xadidnayn.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiin aan xadidnayn','verbUpdate'=>'Cusbooneysii','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku sii waddo cusboonaysiinta?','Update'=>'Cusbooneysii','Update License'=>'Cusbooneysii Shatiga','Upgrade'=>'Cusbooneysii','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Ogeysiiska Cusboonaysiinta Muhiimka ah:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Soo rar oo shaqaysii noocan la soo degsay','User Dashboard'=>'Golaha Isticmaalaha','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Waan ka xumnahay, ma aan badbaadin 