'as annual periodyear'=>'sanad','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'Haa','You are all good!'=>'Wax walba waa hagaag!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Waxaad jirtaa hal tallaabo oo keliya - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata inaad heshay sii-dayntii ugu dambaysay.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Waxaad filan kartaa inaad hesho %3$s ee loogu talagalay %1$s sanduuqaaga boostada ee ku yaal %2$s 5ta daqiiqo ee soo socota.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Koodhka boostada / Xarfaha boostada',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho nooca %2$s cusbooneysiinta amniga iyo sifooyinka, iyo taageero.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s cusbooneysiisyada amniga iyo sifooyinka tooska ah iyo shaqeynta lacagta ah waxay sii wadi doonaan inay shaqeeyaan iyadoon kala go\' la lahayn ilaa %2$s (ama marka shatigaagu dhaco, kaas oo soo horreeya).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho nooca %2$s ee amniga & casriyeynta sifooyinka, iyo taageerada.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay intii lagu jiray isku dayga lagu dejinayay habka beta ee isticmaalaha.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay inta lagu guda jiray isku dayga lagu beddelayo habka calaamadda cad ee shatiga.','Annual'=>'Sanadle','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Opt Out", %s ma awoodi doonto in ay sii aragto magacaaga iyo iibsigaaga.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha mar dambe looma diri doono %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Marka laga jaro mareegta, xogta baaritaanka ee horay loo wadaagay ee ku saabsan %1$s waa la tirtiri doonaa mana sii muuqan doonto %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Adigoo ka doorbidaya in aanad xogtan la wadaagin server-ka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad ka hubisaa sii-daymaha cusub ee %1$s oo aad gacanta ku soo dejisaa oo aad rakibtaa. Kaliya ma aha dhibaato, laakiin seegista cusboonaysiinta waxay gelin kartaa mareegtaada halis waxayna keeni kartaa dhibaatooyin waafaqsan oo aan loo baahnayn, markaa waxaan si xoog leh ugu talineynaa in la hayo ogolaanshaha muhiimka ah.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni mar dambe wax cusboonaysiin ah oo ku saabsan amniga & astaamaha, mana u baahni taageero ku saabsan %2$s sababta oo ah ma qorshaynayo inaan isticmaalo %3$s kan, ama degel kale midkoodna.','Cancel %s?'=>'Jooji %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Waa la joojiyaa %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Waa la joojiyaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Deactivating'=>'Joojinaya','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Joojinta xiriirka shabakadda waxay si joogto ah uga saari doontaa %s koontadaada Dashboardka Isticmaalaha.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si loo helo amniga & casriyeynta sifooyinka si otomaatig ah, iyo maamulka & ilaalinta liisanka, %s wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo geeyo ammaan & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maamulka shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay in','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa shatigayaga iyo matoorayada cusboonaysiinta barnaamijka','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani ay tahay nuqul muddo dheer ah, si aad u ilaaliso cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqaynta lacagta lagu bixiyo %1$s kadib, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ma %2$s ma nuqul baa ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Sannad-sharciga','License Key'=>'Furaha Sharciga','License key'=>'Sharciga rukhsadda','Monthly'=>'Bishii','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, gaabisyada, noocyada, iyo haddii ay shaqeynayaan iyo inkale','New Version Available'=>'Nooca Cusub Waa La Heli Karaa','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Alaabooyinka','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Wadaagista xogta ogaanshaha waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegtaada, ka fogaanshaha WordPress ama noocyada PHP ee aan is-waafaqayn ee jebin kara mareegta, iyo aqoonsiga luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo laguna hagaajiyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Si aad u awooddo inaad dib u isticmaasho ruqsadda marka %s uusan mar dambe shaqaynayn.','Subscription'=>'Rukun-dhaqmeed','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s waxay si joogto ah ugu diri doontaa xogta ruqsadaha muhiimka ah %2$s si ay u hubiso amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta astaamaha, hamigana u xaqiijiso saxnaanta ruqsadadaada.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa jira %1$s oo ah %2$s oo la heli karo.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo hubiyo waafaqidda loogana fogaado is-khilaafka plugins-kaaga iyo mawduucyadaada ku rakiban.','Trial'=>'Imtixaan','View %s State'=>'Eeg Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s ujeedada tijaabinta, marxaladda, ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shati %s ah.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shati ah %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waxa lagugu soo diri doonaa iimayl xaqiijin ah oo ku saabsan %1$s sanduuqaaga iimaylka ee %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad gujiso badhanka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad u %3$s.','days'=>'maalmo','deactivating'=>'deminaya','hour'=>'saacad','hours'=>'saacadaha','license'=>'sharciga ruqhterska','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari ah','products'=>'alaabta','skip'=>'ka bood','subscription'=>'is-diiwaangelinta','trial'=>'tijaabo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Alaabooyinka','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Waa la howlgeliyaa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Sannad-sharciga','close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska indha-tir','close windowDismiss'=>'Iska tuur','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Tijaabo','verbOpt In'=>'Ku biir','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Casriyee','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s ka hor','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Tallaabada lama soo gabagabeeyo. Dib u day, oo haddii ay sii waddo in ay fashilanto, la xiriir maamulaha mareegaha.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiime loo baahan yahay ayaa maqan ama leh qaab khaldan. Hubi nidaamka gelinta awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Goobtu waxay diiday codsiga.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI wakiilada (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay ka shaqeeyaan boggan adiga iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay u soo galaan sidii isticmaale WordPress ah oo wata eray-sirta codsiga waxayna qaban karaan oo kaliya waxa loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo isticmaalahaas.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Demek: qalabka hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba lama diiwaangeliyo.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Ciwaanka xiriirka (MCP endpoint)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Abuur erayga sirta ah ee codsiga ee isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Tan ku dar dejinta MCP ee abkaaga AI, adigoo isticmaalaya magacaaga isticmaale iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: geli gelitaan la mid ah hoosta "servers" ee .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha ka hoos marin "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Agabka wakiilka AI uu halkaan isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Ku dhis oona wax ka beddel bogaggan mareegaha qaybaha Page Builder Sandwich iyo xirmooyinka mareegaha.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Bogag, qaybo iyo xirmooyinka mareegaha.','List pages'=>'Liiska bogagga','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa boggaga aad wax ka bedeli karto, kuwa ugu cusub marka hore, iyada oo ay jirto raadin ikhtiyaari ah.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Erayada laga raadinayo cinwaanka iyo waxa ku jira.','Read a page'=>'Akhriso bogag','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Waxay soo celineysaa cinwaanka bogga, heerka, xiriiriyeyaasha iyo waxa ku jira blocks-ka, iyo qeybaha (blocks-ka heerka sare ah) ee uu ka kooban yahay.','Create a page'=>'Abuur bogag','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Waxay ka abuurtaa bog qaybo (eeg pbs/list-sections) iyo/ama waxyaabaha ku jira baloogga. Bogga cusub waa qabyo ilaa xaalad kale la codsado mooyaane.','Update a page'=>'Cusboonaysii bogga','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Waxay bedeshaa cinwaanka bogga, xaaladdiisa ama waxa ku jira block-ga. Agabka aad dirto wuxuu beddelayaa waxa uu boggu ka kooban yahay.','List sections'=>'Qaybaha liiska','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Waxay liiska saaraysaa qaybaha diyaarka ah (halyeeyga, sifooyinka, FAQ, marag-kacyada, baaqa ficilka iyo kuwo kale) ee lagu dari karo bogga.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Errayada lagu jaan-qaadayo magaca qaybta ama kelmaddaha muhiimka ah.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ku dar qayb bogag ku yaal','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Wuxuu ku darayaa qayb diyaarsan bog: bilowga, dhammaadka, ama ka dib qaybta boos gaar ah.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Magaca qaybta ee ka yimid pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Booska "after": booska ku salaysan 0-da ee qaybta la gelinayo kadib.','List website kits'=>'Liiska xirmooyinka mareegaha','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Waxay qortaa qalabka mareegaha (oo ah bogag diyaarsan oo loogu talagalay hal nooc oo ganacsi ah) ee uu site-kani soo dejisan karo.','Import a website kit'=>'Sooji geli xirmada mareegta','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Waxay soo dejisaa bogagga xirmada mareegaha (dhammaantood, ama kuwa la magacaabay), iyada oo ikhtiyaar ahaan daabacaysa, dejinaysa bogga guriga oo ku dareysa liiska. Soo dejinta mar labaad waxay cusbooneysiisaa bogaggaas oo kale.','List the builder blocks'=>'Liis garee baloogyada dhismaha','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Waxay soo qoraysaa baloog kasta oo Page Builder Sandwich ah oo goobtan loo adeegsan karo (baloogyada Pro ka mid yihiin marka Pro uu shaqaynayo): magaca, cinwaanka, qaybta iyo sharraxaadda. U adeegso pbs/get-block dejinta baloogga, ka dibna baloogga geli nuxurka bogga.','Describe a builder block'=>'Sharax block-ga dhismaha','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa dejinta hal baloog ah (sifooyinka ay wataan noocyadooda, xulashadooda iyo kuwa caadiga ah), waxa ay taageerto, baloogyada ay yeelan karto, iyo tusaale diyaar u ah in la isticmaalo oo ku jira calaamadaynta baloogga.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Halka uu blocks-ku ku yaallo: booskiisa qaybaha bogga dhexdiisa, ka dibna blocks-ka hoose ee block-kaas dhexdiisa, iyo wixii la mid ah (oo ka bilaabmaya 0), sida uu pbs/get-page u liis gareeyay.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Beddel dejinta hal baloog','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Wuxuu beddelaa dejinta (sifooyinka) hal blocks oo ku dhex jira bog, oo lagu helay jidkiisa; sifooyinka aad dirto waxaa lagu daraa kuwa hadda jira. Waxay ka shaqaysaa blocks-ka uu boggu ka soo saaro dejintooda; block uu HTML-kiisu ku kaydsan yahay bogga, u dir qoraal cusub oo ah pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Ka saar baloog bogga','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Waxay bog ka saartaa hal baloog (qayb dhan, ama baloog ku dhex jira), oo laga helay jidkeedii (path). Bogga noociisii hore wuxuu ku jiraa dib-u-eegisyadiisa.','Move a section'=>'U raraan qayb','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Waxay u rartaa qayb ka mid ah bogga meel ka duwan (0-ku salaysan, sida pbs/get-page ay u taxdo).','Duplicate a page'=>'Nuqul ka samee bogag','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Waxay ka nuqulisaa bog (ciwaankiisa, waxa ku jira iyo qaab-dhismeedkiisa) qabyo cusub.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Bog u rar qashin-qubka','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Bogga wuxuu u raraa qashinka. Waxaa laga soo celin karaa Bogagga, Qashinka muddo 30 maalmood ah.','Build a landing page'=>'Samee bogga caga-deynta','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Habraac hannaansan: wakiilku waxa uu doortaa qaybaha ku habboon ganacsigaaga, waxa uu dhisaa bogga oo ah qabyo, waxa uuna qoraa qoraalkiisa.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Ganacsiga, soo-jeedintiisa iyo dhagayste-beegtiisa.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Boggu wuxuu noqon karaa qabyo, in la sugo dib-u-eegis, la daabacay ama gaar loo leeyahay.','Give the page a title.'=>'Bogga u bixix cinwaan.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s waxay HTML-keeda ku keydisaa bogga dhexdiisa, markaa dejinteeda keligood lama beddeli karo. U dir calaamadaynta cusub ee bogga pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (nuqul)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Bogga lama rari karo qashin-qubka.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Ku dhis bogag soo degitaan ah boggan WordPress ee ku saabsan: %s. Tillaabooyinka: 1) wac pbs-list-sections oo dooro 4 ilaa 6 qaybood oo ah siday u kala horreeyaan oo macquul ah (geesi marka hore, yeeritaan ficil ah marka dambe); 2) wac pbs-create-page oo wata ciwaan iyo qaybahaas, oo ah qabyo; 3) wac pbs-get-page oo dib u qor qayb kasta oo ka mid ah qoraalka meel-hayaha ah ee ganacstan adoo adeegsanaya pbs-update-page (ilaali faallo kasta oo xannibaad ah iyo summadda sida ay tahay); 4) haddii pbs-generate-page ay diyaar tahay, waxaad isticmaali kartaa halkii aad ka heli lahayd tillaabooyinka 1 ilaa 3; 5) soo sheeg xiriiriyaha tafatirka ee bogga hana daabicin adiga oo aan weydiin.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Ma jiro block meeshaas. Marka hore ku akhri bogga pbs/get-page.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Ma jiro baloog la yiraahdo "%s". Eeg pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Boggu ma laha qayb meeshaas ah.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Kaasi ma aha magac xirmo. Eeg pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Ma jiro qayb la yiraahdo "%s". Eeg pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Magacyada qaybaha ee ka yimid pbs/list-sections, iyagoo ku jira nidaamka bogga. Waxay yimaadaan ka hor wax kasta oo la bixiyay.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Markabka block (qaabka tifaftiraha block uu keydiyo).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Ma jirto bog leh aqoonsigaas.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Uguma oggolaan inaad sidaas ku samayso boggan.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Ku xidh Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Waxay ku xiraysaa mashruuc shabakadeed Adobe Fonts (Typekit) iyada oo loo marayo aqoonsigeeda kit-ka, si fartaheedu uga muuqdaan xulayaasha fartooda.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Beddel xirmada summada (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Waxay kaydisaa xirmada summadda: magaca, astaanta, midabada, farta madaxa iyo jidhka, iyo codka summada ee ay adeegsato qorista AI.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Driso xirmada astaanta (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Wuxuu midabada iyo farta xirmada sumcadda ee la keydiyay ku dabaqayaa naqshadda bogga.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Akhriso dhibcaha kala-guurka ee jawaabta leh','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa ballaca tablet-ka iyo mobilka (iyo xadka caadiga ah ee Pro) ee ay isticmaalaan kontaroolada jawaabta leh.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Beddel meelaha jebinta ee jawaabta leh','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Waxay bedeshaa ballaca kiniiniga iyo mobilada ee biiksel; oo leh Pro, barta jebinta ee dheeraadka ah ee gaarka ah.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Abuur fasal caalami ah (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Waxay abuureysaa fasal qaab caalami ah oo dib loo isticmaali karo: calaamadda, slug-ga iyo qaababkeeda (s).','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Tirtir caalami (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa fasal guud. Walxaha isticmaalayay waxay sii haystaan waxa ku jira, laakiin waxay waayaan qaababkiisa.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Beddel fasalka caalamiga ah (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa sumadda, magaca gaaban ama qaabka fasalka guud; curiyaha kasta ee adeegsada waa la cusbooneysiiyaa.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Nuqul ka samee fasalka caalamiga ah (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Waxay koobiyaysaa fasal caalami ah oo hoos yimaada id cusub.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Shid farta la soo geliyay (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Wuxuu ka dhigayaa farta caadiga ah ee la soo geliyay (faylka farta ee ku jira maktabadda warbaahinta, iyada oo loo marayo aqoonsiga) mid laga heli karo xulayaasha farta.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Dami faragelinta la soo geliyey (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Waxay ka saaraysaa farta gaarka ah (slug) xulayaasha farta.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Beddel qaabka madow (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Waxay dejisaa habka madow (habka: damisay, otomaatig ama kala badal) iyo midabadeeda.','Read the site design'=>'Akhri naqshadda bogagga','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa midabada iyo farshaxannada guud ahaan bogga (ciwaanka iyo qoraalka) ee uu baloog kasta isticmaalo, sida ay shaashadda Naqshadda boggu u tusto.','Change the site design'=>'Beddel naqshadda bogga','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa midabada bogagga oo dhan (colors), farta qoraalka (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Bog kastaa wuu qaataa isbeddelka; theme.json ee mawduuca waa la waafajiyaa.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Akhri nidaamka naqshadaynta (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Wuxuu soo celinayaa nidaamka naqshadaynta Pro: fasallada caalamiga ah, doorsoomayaasha, calaamadaha naqshadaynta, qaabka mugdiga ah, xirmada sumadda iyo xarfaha gaarka ah.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Beddel calaamadaha naqshadda (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Waxa ay beddeshaa cabbirrada bannaaneynta, shucaaca iyo hooska (bannaan, shucaac, hoos), ama dib bay u dejineysaa (dib-u-dejinta).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Bedel doorsoomayaasha CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Waxay beddeshaa doorsoomayaasha naqshadda bogga (doorsoomayaasha: liis ka kooban magac iyo qiime).','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Ka saar farta guriga lagu martigeliyay','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa faylasha qoyska farta ee boggan isagu martigeliyo.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Liiska faramqoriska isku-martiyaliya','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Wuxuu qorayaa farqadaha Google ee uu boggani martigeliyo (hal mar ayaa la soo dejiyay, waxaa laga adeegayaa bogga, codsi loogu diray Google ma jiro).','Self-host a font'=>'Keydi xarfaha bartaada','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Waxay soo dejisa കുടുംബ qoyska farta Google (family, weights, italic) waxayna ka soo adeegtaa boggan.','List forms'=>'Liiska foomamka','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa foomamka lagu dhisay xannibaadda Foomka iyo furayaasha foomka ee ay ku dhex dari karto.','List uploaded icons'=>'Liiska astaamaha la soo geliyey','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa calaamadaha SVG ee lagu soo raray maktabadda calaamadaha, iyadoo kuwa ugu cusub ay horreeyaan.','Upload an icon'=>'Soo geli astaamaha','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Waxay ku dareysaa sumad SVG ah (magac, calaamadaynta svg) maktabadda sumadaha; SVG-ga waa la nadiifiyaa marka hore.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Tirtir astaanta la soo geliyay','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Waxay ka saaraysaa astaanta la soo geliyay; baloogyada isticmaalay waxay haystaan nuqulkooda.','Read the licence'=>'Akhri shatiga','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa qorshaha Page Builder Sandwich ee boggan, heerka liisanka, taariikhda cusboonaysiinta iyo waxa uu qorshuhu ku jiro.','Revoke temporary support logins'=>'Baabi\'i galitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','Removes temporary support users now (ids).'=>'Hadda ka saar isticmaaleyaasha taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah (aqoonsiyada).','List temporary support logins'=>'Liiska gelitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','Lists the temporary support users granted to our team and when each expires.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa isticmaaleyaasha taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah ee la siiyay kooxdeena iyo goorta mid kasta uu dhacayo.','Disconnect from support'=>'Ka jaro taageerada','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Go\'omo goobtan taageerada.','Read the support connection'=>'Akhriso xiriirka taageerada','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa in boggan uu ku xiran yahay taageerada Zinn Digital®, iyo sida uu u yahay.','Connect to support'=>'Ku xidhnow taageerada','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Wuxuu degelkan ku xirayaa taageerada Zinn Digital® (magaca, iimaylka, oggolaanshaha).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Ogow oggolaanshaha ogaanshaha ciladaha taageerada','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Waxay diiwaangelisaa ogolaanshaha maamulaha si loo soo diro xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha iyadoo la adeegsanayo tigidhada taageerada.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Akhriso ogaanshaha cilladaha bogga','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Wuxuu soo celiyaa baaritaannada uu kaarka taageerada sani lahaa: noocyada, qalabka dheeriga ah ee shaqaynaya, xadka iyo khaladaadkii ugu dambeeyay.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fur tigidh taageero ah','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email) with this site\'s diagnostics; access_days and credentials optionally grant our team temporary access.'=>'Waxay feylgaraysaa tigidh taageero ah (mawduuca, farriinta, nooca, iimeejka) oo wata baaritaannada boggan; access_days iyo aqoonsiyada ayaa si ikhtiyaari ah u siinaya kooxdayada marin-u-helid ku-meel-gaar ah.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bilow tijaabada bilaashka ah ee Pro','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Waxay bilaabeysaa tijaabada 14-ka cisho ee Page Builder Sandwich Pro ee boggan (lacag looma baahna).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Akhri akoonka maktabadda daruuriga ah (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa isticmaalka keydka daruuraha, xaddiga qorshaha iyo xaqiiqooyinka kooxda.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Qor naqshadaha maktabadda daruuraha (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Waxay liiska ku dartaa naqshadaha ku kaydsan maktabadda daruuraha (nooca: qayb, bog ama qaab; kooxda: maktabadda koox).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Keydso naqshad ku jirta maktabadda daruuraha (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Waxay kaydinaysaa calaamadaynta baloogga (cinwaanka, nooca, calaamadaynta, qaababka, calaamadaha) maktabaddaada daruuraha ama midda kooxda; sawirada ayaa la socda.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Tirtir naqshad maktabadda daruuriga ah (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Waxay naqshad ka masaxdaa maktabadda daruuraha.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Helo naqshad maktabad daruur ah (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa hal naqshad oo la kaydiyay, oo diyaar u ah in lagu daro boggan (sawiradeedana la keenay maktabadda warbaahinta).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Ka tag kooxda (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Wuxuu ka tegayaa maktabadda kooxda ee uu degelkani ku biiray.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Ku biir koox (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Waxay ku biirisaa maktabad kooxeed iyadoo la adeegsanayo koodh martiqaad ah.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Jooji isticmaalka keydkaaga (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Waxay meesha ka saaraysaa habaynta kaydintaada ah ee aad keentay; kaydinta qorshaha ayaa mar labaad la isticmaalayaa.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Akhriso dejinta kaydka gaarka ah (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa goobaha keydka ee R2/S3 ee la keenay (sirta waligeed lama soo celiyo).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Isticmaal keydkaaga gaarka ah (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Kaydi kaydkaaga aad keensatay: bixiyaha (r2 ama s3), kaydka, gobolka, barta dhamaadka, horgalaha, key_id, secret, la hawlgeliyay.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Imtixaan keydkaaga (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Wuxuu qoraa, akhriyaa oo tirtiraa shay tijaabo ah oo ku jira kaydkaaga wuxuuna ka bixiyaa warbixin tallaabo kasta.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Liiska kooxaha maktabadda (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Waxay qortaa kooxaha uu baddankani ka tirsan yahay ama uu leeyahay.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Abuur koox maktabad ah (Wakaalad)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa maktabad kooxeed (name) taas oo mareegaha kale ay ku biiri karaan iyaga oo isticmaalaya koodka casumadda.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Tirtir kooxda maktabadda (Wakaaladda)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa koox iyo naqshad kasta oo ku jirta maktabaddeeda.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Ku martiqaad bog koox (Wakaalad)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Waxay abuureysaa koodh martiqaad oo hal jeer la isticmaalo (doorka: akhris ama qor; sumad; maalmaha uu shaqeynayo). Koodhka waxaa la tusiyaa hal jeer.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Liiska xubnaha kooxda (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Wuxuu qorayaa boggaga ku jira kooxda iyo gelitaankooda.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Ka saar xubin kooxeed (Wakaalad)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Waxay ka saaraysaa degel koox.','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Qorista animations-ka Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Waxay ku liisaysaa animations-ka Lottie ee la soo geliyay.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Soodaji animation-ka Lottie (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Wuxuu ansixinayaa dukumeentiga Lottie JSON (json, name) wuxuuna u daabacaa sidii fayl taagan oo loogu talagalay xannibaadda Lottie.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Liiska tijaabooyinka A/B iyo natiijooyinkooda (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa imtixaanada A/B ee leh booqdayaasha iyo beddelka nooc kasta, iyo midka guuleysanaya.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Abuur imtixaanka A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Waxay ku dareysaa tijaabada laba nooc oo qayb ah dhamaadka qoraalka (post, name, a, b; split iyo goal waa ikhtiyaari).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Dib u deji natiijooyinka imtixaanka A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Waxay nadiifisaa tirakoobka imtixaanka waxayna dib u bilowdaa (imtixaanka).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Liiska xiriirinta liiska boostada (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Waxay qortaa adeegyada liiska iimaylada (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) iyo kuwa ku xiran. Furayaasha laguma soo celiyo abid.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Ku xidh adeeg liiska boostada (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Waxay ku xiraysaa adeegga liiska boostada oo wata furaha API-giisa (adeeg, fure; akoon halkaas oo adeeggu u baahan yahay mid), ama way ka jartaa fure madhan.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Liiska boostada ee adeeg (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa dhagaystayaasha ama liisaska adeeg boosto oo ku xidhan, oo loogu talagalay ficilka is-diiwaangelinta foomka.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Akhri ogolaanshaha buskudka (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa summada oggolaanshaha: inay shaqeyneyso iyo inkale, qoraalkeeda iyo naqshadeeda, qaybaha, iyo halka ay khusayso.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Beddel calanka oggolaanshaha buskutugga (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa boodhadhka oggolaanshaha. Inta uu shaqeynayo, qoraallada dabagalka waxay sugayaan oggolaanshaha booqashada.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Abuur banner-ka buskudka bilowga ah (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa nashqad ogolaansho diyaarsan oo laga bilaabo.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Liiska foomamka dhismaha foomka (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Waxay qortaa dhammaan foomamka lagu sameeyay dhisaha foomka: bogga ay ku jiraan, beertaheeda iyo waxa dhaca marka la diro.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Abuur foom (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Wuxuu abuuraa foom (xiriir, xigasho, is-diiwaangelin ama tillaabooyin badan: goobaha, tillaabooyinka, dejinta iyo ficillada sida iimaylka, kaydinta, webhook ama liiska boostada), bog cusub ama dhammaadka qoraal jira (qoraal).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Beddel foom (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Isbeddellada hal foom (qoraal, foom): dejinta iyo ficillada waxay la midoobayaan waxa halkaa yaal; beeraha (iyo tallaabooyinka) waxay beddelayaan beeraha.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Tax lista habaynta animation-ka iyo isdhexgalka (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Waxay soo celineysa leexin kasta oo mooshin ah (sida muuqashada bilowga, dhererkeeda iyo dib u dhaceeda, saamaynta duubidda, saamaynta dul-heynta, ku jirrida muuqaalka, parallax, iyo raacitaanka tusaha) oo wata doorashooyinkiisa ama xadka uu gaarsiisan yahay, iyo dhibcaha kala go\'a ee websaytka.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Noolow blocks (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Wuxuu dejiyaa ama ka saaraa (null) dejinta dhaqaaqa ee hal xir oo bog ku jira, oo lagu helo jidkiisa, barta jabinta (base haddii aan la cayimin). Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa xir kasta, oo ay ku jiraan xirarka aasaasiga ah ee HTML-koodu ku kaydsan yahay bogga. Booqdayaasha codsada dhaqaaq yar weligood ma arkaan dhaqaaqa.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Liis garee daaqadaha soo booda (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Waxay taxdaa daaqadaha soo booda, kuwa dhinaca ka soo gala iyo xariijimaha, iyo waxa kiciya, xeerarka inta jeer ee ay muuqdaan iyo meelaha ay ka muuqdaan.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Samee popup (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa popup, slide-in ama bar: waxa ku jira, kiciyaha (exit intent, scroll, time, click), inta jeer ee ay soo baxayso iyo bogagga ay ka muuqato.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Beddel bood-baxeedka (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Wax ka beddelaya soo-bax (popup), slide-in ama bar (id): nuxurka, kicinaha, inta jeer ee ay soo baxayso ama halka ay ka muuqato.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Akhri foomka la soo gudbiyey (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Waxay qortaa waxa ay soo direen dadka booqday ee ku soo diray foomamka keydiya gudbinta (foomku wuu koobayaa), hal bog markiiba.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Akhri raadraaca beddelka (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel dejinta iyo gujiinta iyo gudbinta foomamka ee la diro.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Bedel raadraaca beddelka (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa habaynta Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel iyo dhacdooyinka la dirayo.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Akhri haajiraddii hore','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa horumarka iyo warbixinta beddelka nuxurka ee 5.x.','Convert legacy content'=>'Beddel waxyaabaha duugga ah','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa (ama dib u billaabayaa) beddelidda bog kasta oo ah 5.x una beddelaya baloogyo; qoraal kasta waxaa horay loogu sameeyaa keyd.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Ka noqo guuritaanka hore','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Wuxuu soo celinayaa qoraal kasta oo la beddelay kaydkisii.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Akhri isku xirka warka (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa in furaha Mailchimp la keydiyay (furaha laftiisa laguma soo celiyo).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Xiriiri Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Waxay kaydisaa (ama, oo ay leedahay qiime madhan, ay ka saartaa) furaha Mailchimp API ee uu isticmaalo baloogga warka.','Convert one legacy page'=>'U beddel hal bog duug ah','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Waxay u beddeshaa hal bog oo ah 5.x blocks (horay ayaa loo kaydiyay).','Undo one conversion'=>'Ka la noqo hal beddelid','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Wuxuu soo celiyaa hal bog oo la beddelay oo laga keenay keydkiisa.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Akhriso ilaha faallooyinka (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Waxay soo celisa ilaha Google iyo Trustpilot ee uu xannibaadda Faallooyinka muujinayo.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Beddel ilaha dib u eegista (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Waxay dejisa gole Google iyo ganacsi Trustpilot ah oo uu akhrinayo baloogga Faallooyinka.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Hadda cusbooneysii faallooyinka (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Wuxuu soo qaadaa dib u eegisyadii ugu dambeeyay ee Trustpilot hadda halkaas oo uu sugo dib u cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Akhri dejinta plugin-ka','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Waxay soo celineysaa horgalaha fasalka hore-u-socodka (front-end class prefix), xaaladda cusboonaysiinta beta, iyo in wakiillada AI (MCP) la oggol yahay iyo in kale.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Beddel goobaha plugin-ka','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Wax ka beddelaya horgalaha fasalka hore-u-socota (1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambaro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf) iyo/ama shidaya ёm/daminaya wakiilada AI (MCP) (mcp: false waxay meesha ka saaraysaa dhammaan awoodaha iyo barta dhammaadka ee MCP).','Export designs and settings'=>'Dhoofinta nashqadaha iyo dejinta','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Wax dhoofiya qaababka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada (ids) la doortay iyo, si ikhtiyaari ah, dejinta hal xirmo oo loogu talagalay goob kale.','Import designs and settings'=>'Soo deji naqshadaha iyo dejinta','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Waxay soo dejineysaa xirmo uu sameeyay pbs/export-designs (dryRun marka hore si loo arko waxa isbedeli lahaa; habka: skip ama replace; media; settings).','List what can be exported'=>'Liis garee waxa la dhoofin karo','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa qaababka, qaab-dhismeedyada iyo dejinta loo dhoofin karo degmo kale.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Akhriso habka dayactirka (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'So celinta dayactirka / habka soo socda: habka, bogga, dib-u-dayactirka kadib iyo doorarka weli arka bogga.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Beddel habka dayactirka (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Waxay shidaysaa ama daminaysaa dayactirka (503) ama habka dhowaan-imaanaya (mode), iyada oo wadata bogga la tusi lahaa (page_id), retry_after iyo doorka ka dhaafta.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Liisaska shaqooyinka hel iyo beddel (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Wuxuu taxayaa shaqooyinka raadinta iyo beddelka ee degmada oo dhan iyo xaaladdooda.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Raadi oo bedel dhammaan bogga (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa raadin-iyo-beddelid block-safe ah (raadi, beddel, nooca: qoraal, xiriiriye ama midab; match_case; noocyada). Waxba ma beddelmayaa ilaa laga gaaro pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Horra-u-fiiri raadi oo beddel (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa natiijooyinka shaqada ee is waafaqsan, bogag bogag ah, si loo eego ka hor intaan la codsan.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Codso raadin-iyo-beddelid (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Waxay codsaneysaa shaqo la horraaleeyay. Qoraal kasta oo la beddelay wuxuu hayaa keyd (backup) loogu talagalay pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Ka noqo raadinta-iyo-beddelka (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qoraallada uu shaqadu beddeshay (qoraal la taftiray tan iyo markaas wuxuu hayaa tafatirkiisa).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Akhriso ogolaanshaha dhisaha (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa doorka isticmaali kara dhisaha, naqshadda, koodka iyo qaababka (habka macmiilka).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Bedel ogolaanshaha dhisaha (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Waxay u dejisaa door kasta waxa uu dhisuhu oggolyahay (doorarka), tusaale ahaan door macmiil oo ah nuxur-kaliya.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Akhriso calaamadda cad (Wakaaladda)','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Waxay soo celineysaa habaynta calaamadda cad: shid ama dami, magaca la muujiyo iyo isticmaaleyaasha weli arka midka asalka ah.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Beddel calaamadda cad (Wakaaladda)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Wuxuu shidayaa ama daminayaa calaamadda cad wuxuuna dejiyaa magaca ay macaamiishu arkaan (enabled, name, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Sameeyo dhowr bogod','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Wuxuu abuuraa ilaa 50 bogag ah hal wicitaan, mid walba oo ka mid ah qaybaha iyo/ama waxa ku jira baloogga. Bog kasta waa la hubiyaa oo si gooni ah ayaa loo abuuraa; jawaabtu waxay qortaa bog kasta oo la sameeyay iyo mid kasta oo la diiday, iyada oo wadata sababta.','Write a page with AI'=>'Ku qor bogga AI','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Wuxuu ka dhisayaa bog qaybaha (ee la bixiyay, ama ay AI ka dooratay maktabadda qaybaha) wuxuuna ka dhigaa in AI ay dib u qorto dhammaan qoraalkeeda si waafaqsan qoraalkaaga kooban, iyadoo ilaalinaysa naqshadeynta. Waxay isticmaashaa adeeg bixiyaha AI ee lagu habeeyay dejinta AI ee biraawsarka (plugin). Boggu waa qabyo ilaa inta xaalad kale la codsanayo.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Waxa uu boggu u taagan yahay: ganacsiga, dalabka, dhegeystayaasha iyo codka.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'U dir int u dhaxeysa 1 iyo %d bog.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'Saldhigan ma aha mid ay AI ku jirto.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'U sharax bogga ugu yaraan hal jumlad.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI-gu ma dooran qayb ka mid ah maktabadda. Adigu magacaw qaybaha, ama isku day sharaxaad dheer oo cad.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI-gu waxay dib u qortay %1$d qaybood oo ka mid ah %2$d qaybood ee qoraalka bogga, markaa waxba lama kaydin. Iskayday mar kale.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay. Mar kale isku day.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Tallaabo socdaalka ah ayaa hadda socota. Fadlan mar kale isku day daqiiqad dib.','Rated %s out of 5'=>'Loo qiimeeyay %s 5 ka mid ah','Adults only: %d and over'=>'Dadka waaweyn oo keliya: %d iyo ka weyn','Pros'=>'Faa\'iidooyinka','Cons'=>'Qasaaraha','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s ka mid ah %2$s','Claim offer'=>'Dalbo dalabka','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'Macaamiisha cusub oo keliya. Shuruudaha iyo xeerarku waa kuwo khuseeya.','Rank'=>'Darajada','Operator'=>'Hawlwadeen','Bonus'=>'Dheeraad ah','Rating'=>'Qiimaynta','Highlights'=>'Muhiimadda leh','Visit'=>'Booqo','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply. Please gamble responsibly.'=>'Macaamiisha cusub oo keliya. Shuruudaha iyo xeerarku waa quseeyaan. Fadlan si xilkasnimo leh u khamaar.','%s in 24 hours'=>'%s 24 saacadood gudahood','Prices will appear here shortly.'=>'Qiimayaashu waxay halkan ka muuqan doonaan dhawaan.','Prices from CoinGecko, updated %s'=>'Qiimaha CoinGecko, la cusboonaysiiyay %s','Cryptocurrency prices'=>'Qiimaha cryptocurrency','%1$s: %2$s, up %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, kor u kacay %3$s%% gudaha %4$d maalmood' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, kor u kacay %3$s%% gudaha %4$d maalmood','%1$s: %2$s, down %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, waxay hoos u dhacday %3$s%% muddo %4$d maalin ah' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, hoos u dhacay %3$s%% muddo %4$d maalmood ah','Lowest'=>'Ugu hooseeya','Highest'=>'Ugu sarreeya','Latest'=>'Ugu dambeeya','Are you %d or older?'=>'Ma jirtaa %d sano jir ama ka weyn tahay?','This website is for adults only. Please confirm your age to continue.'=>'Shabakaddani waa dadka waaweyn oo keliya. Fadlan xaqiiji da\'daada si aad u sii waddo.','Sorry, you must be %d or older to visit this website.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, waa inaad jirtaa %d ama ka weyn si aad u booqato mareegtan.','Sorry, this website is not available in your country.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, mareegtani kama shaqeyso dalkaaga.','Your date of birth'=>'Taariikhda dhalashadaada','Day'=>'Maalin','Month'=>'Bil','Year'=>'Sanad','Enter'=>'Geli','Yes, I am %d or older'=>'Haa, waxaan ahay %d sano jir ama ka weyn','Gambling can be addictive. Please play responsibly.'=>'Sharadku wuxuu noqon karaa mid qabatimu. Fadlan si masuuliyad leh u ciyaar.','Get help'=>'Helwaan hel','Responsible gambling'=>'Khamaarka masuuliyadda leh','%d more items loaded.'=>'%d shay oo dheeri ah ayaa la soo raray.','Filter by category'=>'Kala sifee qayb ahaan','All'=>'Dhammaan','Load more'=>'Soo deji wax badan','Show more'=>'Muuji in badan','Show less'=>'Muuji wax yar','Choose what to show