rt a bug'=>'Helpu hel ama ka warbixi cillad','Plugin screens'=>'Screenaha furaha (Plugin screens)','That could not be saved.'=>'Taas lama keydin karin.','Before you contact support'=>'Int IndexPath la xiriirin taageerada','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Codsigaaga waxaa laga soo diray bishan ilaa %s, kuwaas oo sameeya plugins-kan. Waxaan dirnaa:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'cinwaankaaga iimeylka iyo magacaaga, si aan u soo jawaabno;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mawduuca iyo fariinta aad qorto;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'aqoonsigaaga shatiga, si macaamiisha wax bixisa ay mudnaan u helaan;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kaliya haddii aad calaamadiso: faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada WordPress iyo PHP, mawduuca, plugins-ka, qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka oo laga saaray furayaasha sirta ah iyo cinwaannada iimaylka), oo aad akhrisan karto ka hor intaadan dirin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'kaliya haddii aad ku dartid: xogta gelitaanka ee boggaaga, oo loo kaydiyay qaab sir ah oo la tirtiray 30 maalmood kadib marka codsigaaga la xiro.','I agree, continue'=>'Waan ku raacsanahay, sii wad','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Xiriirka lama hubin karo.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Taasi ma aysan shaqayn. Mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® ayaa goysay balseetan.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® horey uma aqoonsaneyso boggan.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Waad jartay goobtan.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ku xidh boggan taageero','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Waa la xirxiiray. Jawaabaha waxay aadayaan %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Lama xiriirin. Weli waxaad soo diri kartaa codsi adoo adeegsanaya cinwaankaaga e-mail-ka ee hoose; ku xiriddu waxay badbaadineysaa in la qoro mar walba.','E-mail address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka','Your name (optional)'=>'Magacaaga (ikhtiyaari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waan ku raacsanahay inaan ku xiro shabakaddan taageerada Zinn Digital®. Waxay soo diraysaa cinwaanka shabakaddan, noocyada WordPress iyo PHP iyo nooca furaha, waxaana la gooyn karaa wakhti kasta halkaan ama Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Isku xidh','I need help'=>'Waxaan u baahanahay caawimaad','Report a bug'=>'Sheeg cayayaan','Send feedback'=>'Dir प्रतिक्रिया','Request a feature'=>'Codso astaamaha','The site details could not be read.'=>'Faahfaahinta goobta lama akhrin karo.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsigaga lama diri karin. Iskuday mar kale daqiiqado kadib.','WordPress admin'=>'Maamulaha WordPress','File manager'=>'Maareeyaha faylasha','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Jawaab-celinta iyo codsiyada astaamaha','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'La dirir. Tixraacaagu waa %s, waxaana jawaabtayada ku soo diri doonaa iimayl.','What is it about?'=>'Maxay ku saabsan tahay?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'U jawaab (iimaylka)','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Maxaad samaysay, maxaad filaysay, maxase dhacay halkii laga filayey?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Ku dar faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada, mawduuca, plugins-ka iyo qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Arag sida saxda ah ee loo diro','Loading…'=>'Soo dejinaya…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Soo-galitaanka taageero (ikhtiyaari ah, oo lagu kaydiyay sir ahaan)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Gelitaanka waxaa la diraa kaliya erayga unuggiisa ah. Ka tag saf halkii aad nus-buuxin lahayd.','Login address'=>'Ciwaanka gelitaanka','Add a login'=>'Ku dar galitaan','Create a temporary support login'=>'Abuur galitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Isticmaale gooni ah oo loogu talagalay kooxdayada taageero, kaas oo aan helayn marin loo helo isticmaaleyaasha, rakibidda plugins-ka ama tafatirka koodka. Waxaa si toos ah loo tirtiraa marka uu dhaco, ama mar kasta oo aad hoos uga noqoto.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Haa, %d maalmood' . "\0" . 'Haa, %d maalmood','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Liiska lama soo dejinin.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Gelitaankaas waa la waayay in meesha laga saaro.','Temporary support logins'=>'Gelitaarka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Midna. Taageeradu waxay soo geli kartaa oo keliya mareegtan haddii aad halkan ka abuurto galitaan.','expired, being removed'=>'dhacay, la saarayaa','expires %s'=>'dhacayaa %s','Revoke now'=>'Hadda laabo','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Xir dalxiiska','Everything in one place'=>'Wax walba hal meel bay yaallaan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tab-alkan wuxuu kuu keenayaa shaashad kasta oo plugin-ka ah: dejinta, xuduudaha, ruqsaddaada, caawinta iyo in ka badan.','Help on every screen'=>'Caawinaad shaashad kasta ah','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fur liiskan si aad u hesho hagaha shaashadda aad ku sugan tahay, dalxiiskan, ama aad naga weydiiso caawimaad.','Light or dark'=>'Iftiinka ama mugdiga','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Dooro iftiin, madow, ama sida kombuyuutarkaaga. Xulashadaada waxaa loo xusuustaa adiga kaliya.','Welcome'=>'Soo dhawoow','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Safarkan gaaban wuxuu tusayaa halka ay wax yaaladu yaalaan. Waa inaad kaga bixi kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo adeegsanaya Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Goobtaada hal eegmo','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Halkan waxaa lagu muujiyaa horumarka habaynta iyo qorshahaaga, iyadoo lala socodsiiyo waxa xiga ee mudan in la qabto.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Qorshahaaga, tirada mareegaha ee uu daboolayo, iyo in nuqulkan mareegtu uu ku xisaabtamayo xadkaas.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Isku day Pro ama kor u qaad','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah adigoon isticmaalin kaarka, kor u qaad, ama cusbooneysiin, dhammaantood halkaan ka samee.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Sifo kasta iyo qorshaha ay ku jirto. Ka raadi sifo ama soo bandhig hal aag markiiba.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Wax badan oo ka socda Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Furayaasha ku shaqeeya kan, iyo adeegyada kooxdaas oo kale. Kaarka aad ku qarisay shaashadaha kale ayaa dib loogu soo bandhigi karaa halkan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Ku xidhnow caawinaad degdeg ah','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Isku xirnaashuhu waa ikhtiyaari. Waxay kuu ogolaanaysaa inaad dirto codsiyada adiga oo aan qorin iimaylkaaga mar kasta, waana aad kala gooyn kartaa mar kasta oo aad rabto.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad ama soo sheeg cayayaan','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Sharax waxa dhacay. Waxaad dooraneysaa in aad ku darto macluumaadka bogga, waanaad arki kartaa waxa uu ka kooban yahay marka hore.','Temporary support access'=>'Helitaanka taageero ku-meel-gaar ah','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Haddii taageeradu u baahan tahay inay eegto gudaha goobtaada, halkan ka samee gal ku-meel-gaar ah. Wuu is tirtiraa marka uu dhaco, waadna ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta.','Tell us what to build'=>'Noo sheeg waxa aad rabto in la dhiso','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'U dir fikir, codsi muuqaal ah ama wixii talo ah. Waxaa si toos ah u gaaraya kooxda.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Tani waxay qaadataa daqiiqado yar waxayna dejineysaa %s si uu si toos ah uga shaqeeyo bishan. Waxaad wax walba badali kartaa markii dambe.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Waa aad diyaar tahay. Haddii wax walba aysan u shaqayn sidii la filayey, hal gujin oo keliya ayaannu jirnaa.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Dhamee','Skip setup'=>'Ka bood habaynta','Import “%s”'=>'Soo dejiso "%s"','%d page imported.'=>'%d bog Murniga la soo dejiyey.' . "\0" . '%d bogag ayaa la soo dejiyay.','edit'=>'wax ka beddel','Pages to import'=>'Bogogyada la soo dhoofinayo','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Hadda daabac bogagga (haddii kale waxaa loo kaydin doonaa sidii qabyo-qoraal)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Bogga guriga ee qalabka u isticmaal bogga hore ee boggaaga','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Ka abuur liis bogagga la soo dejiyay','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'So dejinta waligama beddesho bogaggaaga jira. Dib-u-dejinta agabkaas oo kale waxay cusbooneysiisaa bogagga uu hore u abuuray.','Import'=>'Soo dejinta','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Shabakado dhan oo aad hal guji ku soo dhoofin karto: bogag, qaybo iyo menu, oo diyaar u ah erayadaada iyo sawirradaada. Xidhmooyinku waxay ka yimaadaan Zinn Digital® waxaana kuwo cusub lagu daraa bil kasta.','Search kits'=>'Raadi xirmooyinka','Category'=>'Qeyb','All categories'=>'Dhammaan qaybaha','Free and Pro'=>'Lacag la\'aan iyo Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'U gudub Pro si aad u soo dejiso','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Ma jiro qalab ku habboon miirayaashan.','My library'=>'Maktabaddayda','Team'=>'Kooxda','Storage'=>'Kaydka','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Maktabadaadu waxay ku jirtaa kaydkaaga gaarka ah, markaa wax kooto ah oo Zinn Digital® ah laguma dabaqo.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s oo laga isticmaalay %2$s (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d ee %2$d nashqad · ilaa %3$s naqshad kasta · sawirrada waxaa loo cabbir beddelaa 2560 px waxaana la kaydiyaa hal mar','Deleted from your library.'=>'Waa laga tirtiray maktabaddaada.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Kaydi qayb kasta ama bog kasta oo ka mid ah tifaftiraha: fur liiska blocks-ka ee ⋮ oo dooro "Save to cloud library". Geli naqshadaha la kaydiyay ee laga keenay gudaha guddiga Cloud library ee tifaftiraha, mid kasta oo ka mid ah mareegahaaga.','Show'=>'Muuji','Everything'=>'Wax kasta','Sections'=>'Qaybaha','Styles'=>'Hababka','Size'=>'Cabbirka','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Weli wax ala ah lama kaydin.','Delete'=>'Tirtir','Write a test file'=>'Qor fayl tijaabo ah','Read it back'=>'Dib u akhri','Delete it'=>'Tir tiri','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Guddigaada Cloudflare, fur R2 Object Storage oo abuur bucket (tusaale ahaan “my-pbs-library”). Ka dhig mid gaar ah: ha ku xirin domain dadweyne ah.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Ka fur “Manage API tokens” qaybta R2 oo abuuro furaha API oo leh ogolaanshaha “Object Read & Write”, kuna kooban sanduuqaas keliya.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Koobi Access Key ID-ga iyo Secret Access Key-ga ay muujineyso (furaha qarsoodiga ah waxaa la tusayaa hal mar oo keliya).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Koobiyo barta dhammaadka ee S3 ee koontadaada. Waxay u egtahay sida https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Gobolku waa “auto”.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Geli qiyamada hoose, kaydi, kadib riix “Tijaabi xiriirka”. Maktabadda u beddel keydkaaga kaliya marka tijaabadu guulaysato.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Abuur keyd gaar ah oo leh bixiyahaaga (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO ama adeeg kasta oo S3-ku-habboon).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Abuur furaha gelitaanka ee akhriyi kara, qori kara oo tirtiri kara walxaha ku jira bucket-kaas keliya.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Raadi S3 endpoint (ee Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) iyo gobolka bucket-ka.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 waxay isticmaashaa cinwaannada martigelinta-muqaalka ah: dami "Cinwaannada qaabka-jidadka". Adeegyada kale ee badankoodu waxay isticmaalaan qaabka jidka.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Geli qiimayaasha hoose, keydi, ka dibna riix “Tijaabi xiriirka”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'Dejinta keydinta waa la keydiyay.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Maktabaddaada daruurtu waxay ku jirtaa keydka Zinn Digital® iyadoo wadata booska ay qorshahaagu ku jiraan. Waxaad ku hayn kartaa bucket-kaaga Cloudflare R2 ama S3-compatible badalkeeda: markaas wax kooto ah oo Zinn Digital® ah ma quusayso, goob kasta oo aad ku xidho bucket-kaasna waxay wadaagtaa maktabadda. Maktabadaha kooxdu waxay had iyo jeer isticmaalaan keydka Zinn Digital®.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Ku xidh kaydkaaga adiga leh: tallaabo tallaabo','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Adeeg kale oo S3-ku habboon','Read the full guide'=>'Akhri hage buuxa','S3 endpoint'=>'Barta dhamaadka ee S3','Bucket'=>'Keydka xogta','Region'=>'Gobolka','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: auto.','Access key ID'=>'Aqoonsiga furaha gelitaanka','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Kaydsan. Sifee si aad u ilaaliso.','Secret access key'=>'Furaha gelitaanka ee qarsoodiga ah','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Websitekan ayaa si sir ah ugu kaydsan mana muuqan doono mar dambe. Iskadaa faaruq si aad u ilaaliso.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Go kordhiyay waa lagu kaydiyay boggan. Waligiis looma diro Zinn Digital®.','Path-style addresses'=>'Cinwaannada qaab-waddada ah','Folder in the bucket'=>'Galka ku jira baaldiga','Save'=>'Keydi','Test connection'=>'Tijaabi xiriirka','Remove these settings'=>'Ka saar dejintan','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Maktabaddayda ku hay kaydkan','The connection test passed.'=>'Tijaabada xiriirku waa guuleysatay.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Horta "Tijaabi xiriirka" wad.','Invite a site'=>'Casuumso goob','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Yaa loogu talagalay? (ikhtiyaari ah)','Access'=>'Helitaan','Use designs (read only)'=>'Isticmaal naqshadaha (akhris keliya)','Use and save designs'=>'Isticmaal oo keydi naqshadaha','Create invite code'=>'Abuur koodka martiqaadka','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Koodhkan sii milkiilaha bogga. Wuxuu shaqeeyaa hal mar, muddo 7 maalmood ah, waxaana la tusayaa hadda oo keliya:','Copy'=>'Nuqlu','Members'=>'Xubnaha','No site has joined yet.'=>'Weli ma jiro balse degel ku biiray.','use and save'=>'isticmaal oo keydi','read only'=>'akhri keliya','Delete team'=>'Tir kooxda','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Miyaad tiraysaa kooxdan iyo naqshad kasta oo ku jirta maktabaddeeda?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Boggan wuxuu ku biiray maktabadda kooxda.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Boggan waxa uu isticmaalaa maktabadda kooxda:','Leave'=>'Ka tag','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Ku biir koox wadata koodh casuumaad ah','Join'=>'Ku biir','Your teams'=>'Kooxahaaga','New team name'=>'Magaca kooxda cusub','Create team'=>'Abuur koox','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Abuurista maktabadaha kooxdu waxay la timaadaa qorshaha Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Keydiyada, bogisyada iyo qaababka ku keydi maktabaddaada daruuraha oo mar labaad ku isticmaal dhammaan mareegahaaga. Wakaaladaha waxay la wadaagi karaan maktabad kooxdooda iyo macaamiishooda. Waxaad maktabadda ku hayn kartaa keydka Zinn Digital® ama Cloudflare R2 kuu gaar ah ama weelka S3-ku habboon.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Qalabka mareegaha','Cloud library'=>'Maktabadda daruuraha','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa dhisay Neil Lock, oo ah madaxa fulinta ee Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Nooca %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Mareegta Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Mareegta Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Eeg qorshayaasha Pro iyo qiimahooda','Front-end output'=>'Soosaarka hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo fasalka ah ee uu turjumaaddu ku daabaco bogaggaaga wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa horgalahan, si uusan bogaggu u muujin kan dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinaha Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada beta cusbooneysiin ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada xasiloon kaliya.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Tan kaga beddel bogga Koontada','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta waxaa la siiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee ruqseysan ee ku xiran akoonkooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad ka soo biiri kartaa bogga Akoonka.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Biriishka waa la keydiyay. Bogaggu waxay qaadanayaan ballacyada cusub marka xigta ee la eego.','Breakpoints'=>'Go\'aanka Jebinta','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Qaababka loogu talagalay Tablet-ka waxay khuseeyaan ilaa balaca tablet-ka, kuwa loogu talagalay Mobile-kana ilaa balaca mobile-ka. Qaababka Desktop-ka waxaa lagu dabaqaa meel kasta oo kale.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kiniini: ilaa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Moobilaha: ilaa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Keydi meelaha joogsiga','Use the default widths'=>'Isticmaal ballaca caadiga ah','Settings'=>'Dejinta','Templates & kits'=>'Jaadadka & qalabka','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Codsiga lagu beddelayo qoraalkan ayaa istaagay intii uusan dhammaan, markaa qoraalkii waa la booday. Fur si aad u beddesho, ama mar labaad uga beddel halkan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ma jiro wax kayd ah oo qoraalkan ah oo la soo celiyo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Waxka la beddelay lama keydin karo.','Unknown error.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Weli lama hubin wax nuxur ah oo hore.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'So celinta waxyaabihii hore: %1$d ee %2$d qoraal.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Beddelidda nuxurkii hore: %1$d oo ka mid ah %2$d qoraallo.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Dib-u-dejintii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la soo celiyay, %2$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Beddelidii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la beddelay, %2$d waa sidoodii, %3$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Legacy content'=>'Qoraalka hore','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Bogagga lagu sameeyay noocyadii hore ee Page Builder Sandwich waxaa loo beddelaa baloogag gadaasha dambe. Qoraal kasta waa la kaydiyaa marka hore, si beddelka kasta loo tirtiro karo.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d qoraal ayaa weli haya nuxurkii hore.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal ayaa weli xambaarsan waxyaabaha duugga ah.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d qoraal waxay leedahay keyd.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal waxay leeyihiin keyd.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d qoraal lama xakamayn karo' . "\0" . '%d qoraallo lama maamuli karin','Post %d'=>'Qoraalka %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Beddeliddu waa bilowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaasha; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad u soo celiso dhammaan qoraalladii la beddelay qaabkoodii hore? Isbeddellada lagu sameeyay qoraalladaas wixii ka dambeeyay markii la beddelay waa la lixin doonaa.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Dib u celinta waa billowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaal; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Undo all conversions'=>'Gadaal u celi dhammaan beddelallada','Item'=>'Walxayaal','Open when the page loads'=>'Fur marka boggu rarto','Title is a heading'=>'Cinwaanku waa cinmaan','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Ka dhig cinwaanka madax marka walxuhu ay qaybo ka yihiin bogga, si ay booqdayaashu uga dhex boodaan.','Heading %d'=>'Madaxa %d','Question or section title'=>'Su\'aal ama cinwaanka qaybta','Accordion'=>'Akodiyan','Only one item open at a time'=>'Hal shay oo kaliya ayaa furfuran hal mar','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'U calaamadi sida FAQ ee mashiinnada raadinta','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Waxay ku dareysaa xog habaysan oo FAQ ah oo laga dhisay ciwaanada (su\'aalaha) iyo qoraalkooda (jawaabaha).','Alert'=>'Digniin','Information'=>'Macluumaad','Success'=>'Guul','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Digniinaha iyo khaladaadka waxaa loo sheegaa isticmaaleyaasha akhriyaha shaashadda isla markiiba; macluumaadka iyo ogeysiisyada guusha waxaa la akhriyaa marka ay dhameeyaan waxa ay wadaan.','Show icon'=>'Tus astaamaha','Visitors can close it'=>'Booqdayayaashu waa ay xidhi karaan','Title (optional)'=>'Ciwaan (ikhtiyaari)','Write the message…'=>'Qor fariinta…','Centre'=>'Xarunta','Badge'=>'Calaamad','Colour'=>'Midab','Theme accent'=>'Mowduuca midabkiisa gaarka ah','Neutral'=>'Dhex-dhexaad','Position'=>'Booska','Label'=>'Sumad','Booking calendar'=>'Buugga ballamaha','Service'=>'Adeeg','Booking page address'=>'Ciwaanka bogga ballansashada','For example %s'=>'Tusaale ahaan %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Waxa uu jadwalku qabto, kaas oo ay akhriyaan qalabka wax akhriya ee indhaha la\' isla markaana ka muuqda hoostiisa.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Tani ma aha ciwaanka bogga ballansiga ee %s, markaa waxba kuma soo bixi doonaan bogga.','Preview the calendar'=>'Horumarinta jadwalka','Link address'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirinta','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Badhanka wuxuu muuqdaa marka uu leeyahay calaamad iyo cinmaan labadaba.','Open in a new tab'=>'Ka fur tab cusub','Layout'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka','Buttons below'=>'Badhamada hoose','Buttons beside the text'=>'Badhamada ku xiga qoraalka','Alignment'=>'Isku-dabarridda','Main button'=>'Badhanka ugu weyn','Second button'=>'Badhanka labaad','Heading…'=>'Cinwaan…','One sentence on why…'=>'Hal jumladood oo ku saabsan sababta…','Second button (optional)'=>'Badhanka labaad (ikhtiyaari)','Checklist'=>'Liiska hubinta','Tick colour'=>'Midabka calaamadda','Lines'=>'Safafka','Line %d'=>'Safka %d','Task…'=>'Hawl…','Add line'=>'Kudar sadarka','Language'=>'Luqadda','Detect automatically'=>'Si toos ah u olow','No highlighting'=>'Tilmaam la\'aan','File name'=>'Magaca faylka','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'Waa la tusiyaa koodhka korkiisa, tusaale ahaan functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Lambarka xarigga','Copy button'=>'Koobiyso badhanka','Wrap long lines'=>'Duub safafka dhaadheer','Write or paste code…'=>'Qor ama dhejiso koodhka…','Text'=>'Qoraal','Columns'=>'Madaxyo','Highlight %s'=>'Muuqso %s','Add column'=>'Ku dar tiir','Rows'=>'Safafka','Row %d'=>'Safka %d','Add row'=>'Kudar saf','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Saxeexa (waxa la isbarbardhigayo)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Nooca unugga: %s. Beddel','Phone call'=>'Wicitaanka taleefanka','Text message'=>'Farriinta qoraalka ah','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Badhamada','Phone number, with country code'=>'Lambarka টেলিfoonka, oo wata koodhka dalka','Button text'=>'Badhanka qoraalka','Remove this button'=>'Ka saar badankaan','Add a button'=>'Kudar badhan','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Fariinta WhatsApp ee lagu bilaabayo (ikhtiyaari)','Contact buttons'=>'Badhamada xiriirka','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar lambarka telefoonka, cinwaanka iimaylka ama lambarka WhatsApp dhinaca bidix/midig.','Dual heading'=>'Lab labo ah','Heading level'=>'Heerka cinwaanka','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Isticmaal H1 hal mar boggiisa kasta, cinwaankiisa ugu weyn.','Second part look'=>'Qaybta labaad eeg','Accent colour'=>'Midabka lahjadda','Gradient'=>'Shabag','Outline'=>'Qorshe','Underline'=>'Hoosta ka hoos xariiq','Second part on its own line'=>'Qaybta labaad ee safkeeda gaarka ah','First part'=>'Qeybta koowaad','second part'=>'qaybta labaad','Marker pen'=>'Qalin calaamadeeye','Thick underline'=>'Hoosta xariiqda dhumucda leh','Background'=>'Asalra','Highlight'=>'Muuji','Remove highlight'=>'Ka saar iftiiminta','Drop cap'=>'Xaraf weyn oo bilow ah','Large first letter'=>'Xarafka koowaad ee weyn','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Xarfaha ugu horreeya ee sanduuqa ku jira, dooro qaabka "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Xarafka weyn ee sanduuqa ku jira','Accent bar'=>'Barfaalka lahjadaha','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Xigashada soo baxa (barta la jaanqaadka)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Oraah laga soo xigtay qoraalka, taas oo si weyn loo dhigay agagaarka xariiq midab leh si ay indhaha u soo jiidato.','quote'=>'ora ku xigta','Feature list'=>'Liiska astaamaha','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Teleefannada, sifooyinku had iyo jeer way is dul-saaraan.','Feature %d'=>'Muujinta %d','Own icon'=>'Summaddaada','Feature…'=>'Muujiye…','Describe it…'=>'Sharax…','Add feature'=>'Ku dar astaan','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Ku rakib oo awood geli Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms ama Fluent Forms, kadibna halkan ka dooro mid ka mid ah foomamkeeda.','Form plugin'=>'Foomka furaha (plugin)','Choose a form…'=>'Dooro foom…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s wali ma lahan foomam','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s kama shaqeynayo boggan, markaas foomkan lama soo bandhigi karo.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Liiska foomamka waa la soo dejin waayay.','Form style'=>'Qaabka foomka','Fields'=>'Goobaha','Outlined'=>'La tilmaamay','Filled'=>'Buuxsamay','Underlined'=>'Hoosta laga hoosta xarriiqay','Button width'=>'Ballaca badhanka','Fit the text'=>'Qor qoraalka ku habboon','Full width'=>'Ballac buuxa','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Midabada, farshaxanka, bannaanaynta iyo geesaha waxay ka yimaadaan naqshaddaada mareegaha iyo dejinta naqshadda qaybtan.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'So bandhig foomka laga keenayo foomkaaga plugin-ka, kaas oo loo qaabeeyey inuu waafaqo mareegtaada.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Ma u baahan tahay furaha foomka? Contact Form 7 waa bilaash.','Glossary'=>'Eray-bixin','Sort A to Z'=>'U kala sooc A ilaa Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Boggu wuxuu tusiyaa shuruudaha iyagoo kala ah alifbeetada; halkan waxay ku sugnaanayaan siday ahayd markii aad qortay.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Muuji tusmada A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Xiriiriyaha shuruudaha ee laga isticmaalay meelaha kale ee boggan','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Markii ugu horreysay ee erey kasta uu ka muuqdo qoraalka bogga wuxuu ku xidhmaa qeexitaankiisa. Ciwaanada, badhamada, koodka iyo xiriiriyeyaasha jira waa la iska daayaa.','Terms'=>'Shuruudaha','Term %d'=>'Muddada %d','Term'=>'Muddo','What it means…'=>'Waxa ay ka dhigan tahay...','Add term'=>'Ku dar erey','Icon list'=>'Liiska astaamaha','One below the other'=>'Midka midka kale ka hooseeya','Side by side'=>'Isbarbar dhig','List item…'=>'Qodobka liiska…','Info box'=>'Sanduuqa xogta','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Ama ka dooro astaan kasta oo ka tirsan maktabadda:','Link text'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Sheeg halka uu xiriirku aado ("Arag qiimayahayaga"), ee ha dhihin "Akhri wax dheeraad ah".','A sentence or two…'=>'Hal ama laba jumladood…','section — a thematic section'=>'qeyb —qeyb mawduuc ah','div — no meaning'=>'div — ma laha macne','header — introductory content'=>'madax - waxyaabaha hordhaca ah','footer — closing content'=>'footer — xiraada nuxurka','article — self-contained content'=>'maqaal — ku filan naftiisa','aside — related content'=>'geedka — macluumaadka la xiriira','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — waxa ku jira barta ugu weyn (hal mar boggiikiiba)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — xiriiriyeyaasha hagidda','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Galka (flexbox, tiir)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safka (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Grid','Editing: %s'=>'Wax ka beddelka: %s','Lay out children as'=>'U habee carruurta sida','Inherited (%s)'=>'Dhaxlay (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Blocks-ka is dul saaran','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Jiid shiraarka, ama qor','Content width'=>'Ballaca nuxurka','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Sanduuq (ballaca nuxurka mawduuca)','Minimum height'=>'Joogrsaha ugu yar','HTML tag'=>'Astaamaha HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Samee baloogga oo dhan inuu noqdo xiriiriye ku aaddan','Link text for screen readers'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha ee akhriyayaasha shaashadda','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Waxa xiriirku sameeyo, booqdayaasha aan arki karin baloogga.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Haku ridin xiriiriyeyaal ama badhamo gudaha baloog ku xiran: xiriiriye ku dhex jira xiriiriye kama shaqeeyo biraawsarrada.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Jiido si aad u beddesho cabirka tiirarkan','Drag to resize this row'=>'Jiid si aad u beddesho cabirka safkan','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'U jiid unugyada si aad u dejiso inta tiir iyo saf ee uu block-kani qaadanayo','+ Column'=>'+ Tiirka','− Column'=>'− Khadka toosan','+ Row'=>'+ Safafka','− Row'=>'Safka','Place'=>'Meel','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Geli iskuduwaha ama xiriirka OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'Openstreetmap.org ka raadi goobta, kadibna ka nuquliso ciwaanka bar-browser-ka, ama midig-gujiso khariidada oo dooro "Muuji ciwaanka".','Latitude'=>'Jurolaad','Longitude'=>'Dhigaha dhulka','Zoom'=>'Zoom','Name of the place'=>'Magaca goobta','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa khariidada hoosteeda waxaana akhriya qalabka akhriska shaashadda.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Geli istaahilada (tusaale ahaan 51.5074, -0.1278) ama xiriirinta OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Isku-dudujaha ama xiriiriyaha','Preview the map'=>'Horay u eeg khariidadda','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Ka eeg %1$s, %2$s OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Taariikhda la daabacay','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Taariikhda la cusboonaysiiyay (markii ay ka duwan tahay)','Categories'=>'Qeybaha','Tags'=>'Calaamadaha','Reading time'=>'Waqtiga akhriska','Comment count'=>'Tirada faallooyinka','Details to show'=>'Faahfaahinta la muujinayo','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan hal tafaasiil si aad u tuso.','Progress bar'=>'Barta horumarka','Maximum'=>'Ugu badnaan','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 boqolkiiba; tiro kale kasta oo ah tiro-koob, sida 8 ee 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Muuji boqolleyda','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'Furaha sirta ah waa la dejiyay. Booqashadayaashu waxay arkayaan foomka erayga sirta ah halkii ay ka arki lahaayeen nuxurkan ilaa iyo inta ay ka gelinayaan.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Weli ereyska sirta ah looma dejinin, markaa booqdayaashu wax walba halkan kuma arkaan.','New password'=>'Erayga sirta ah ee cusub','Set the password'=>'Deji erayga sirta ah','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'Furaha sirta ah waa la dejiyay. Kaydi bogga si aad u dhaqangeliso; booqdayaasha furay waxay u baahan doonaan midka cusub.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Haddii Page Builder Sandwich abid la damiyo, waxyaabaha ku jira waxaa loo muujinayaa qof kasta.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Fariinta ku jirta foomka erayga sirta ah (ikhtiyaari)','A/B test'=>'Tijaabada A/B','Test name'=>'Magaca tijaabada','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'B nooca aragta booqdayaasha (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Ujeeddo (ikhtiyaari ah)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Beddelashadu waa gujinta xiriiriye ama badhan, ama foom la diray, oo ku dhex jira nooca. Si halkaas beddelkeeda loo xisaabiyo gujin meel kale oo ka mid ah bogga, geli xulaha CSS-ka, tusaale ahaan #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Eeg natiijooyinka','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Tijaabada A/B waxay u baahan tahay laba nooc oo sax ah.','Button'=>'Badhan','Visit site'=>'Booqo bogga','Style'=>'Habka','Affiliate button'=>'Badhanka xiriiriyaha hawlgalka','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Sii badhanka qoraalkiisa iyo ciwaanka dalabka dhinaca dhinac.','Age check'=>'Hubinta da\'da','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Xannibaalkan geli bogagga u baahan, ama qaybta madaxaaga (header) si aad u daboosho degelladda oo dhan.','Minimum age'=>'Da\'da ugu yar','Ask for'=>'Codso','A yes or no answer'=>'Haa ama maya jawaab','The date of birth'=>'Taariikhda dhalashada','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Xasuusnow jawaabta (days)','Texts'=>'Qoraallada','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Qoraalka ha ka tag madhan si aad u isticmaasho kan caadiga ah. {age}-ka waxaa lagu beddelayaa da\'da ugu yar.','Question'=>'Su\'aal','When the visitor is too young'=>'Markuu soo-boaruhu aad u da\' yar yahay','Countries'=>'Waddamada','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Da\' yar oo ka duwan oo loogu talagalay booqdayaasha ka imaanaya waddan, ama 0 si loo xiro goobta. Waddanku wuxuu ka yimaadaa martigeliyahaaga ama CDN (tusaale Cloudflare); halka aan la aqoon, da\'da ugu yar ee kor ku xusan ayaa quseysa. Kaydka boggu waa inuu hayaa hal nuqul oo waddankiiba ah si sharciyadan loogu dabaqo boggag la keydiyay.','Add a country'=>'Kudar dal','Country code (two letters)'=>'Koodka dalka (laba xaraf)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Tusaale ahaan US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Da\'da ugu yar (0: xiran)','Age gate'=>'Xadka da\'da','The age question shows here.'=>'Su\'aasha da\'da waxay ka muuqataa halkan.','Changing words'=>'Bedelida errayada','Word'=>'Erayga','Add a word'=>'Ku dar eray','Animated headline'=>'Cinwaan socda','Text before'=>'Qoraalka ka horreeya','Text after'=>'Qoraalka ka dambeeya','Effect'=>'Saamaynta','Fade'=>'Dami','Slide up'=>'Kor u jiid','Typing'=>'Qorista','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Waqtiga eraygii kasta (mili-ilbiriqsi)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar ereegyada isbedelaya ee goobaha xannibaadda.','Typewriter'=>'Mashiinka qoraalka','Words fade in'=>'Erayadu way muuqdaan','Words rise in'=>'Erayada ayaa kor u kacaya','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Waqti keliya ayaa la daaraa, marka qoraalka la rog-rogo oo uu soo muuqdo. Booqdayaasha aaladdooda weydiista dhaq-dhaqaaq yar waxay qoraalka u arkaan isaga oo taagan.','Speed'=>'Xawaaraha','Slow'=>'Gaabow','Normal'=>'Caadi','Fast'=>'Degdeg','Write the text to animate…'=>'Qor qoraalka la keydinaayo…','Audio player'=>'Maqal-ciyaareedka','Show or album name'=>'Magaca bandhigga ama albaamka','Replace artwork'=>'Beddel sawirka farshaxanka','Choose artwork'=>'Xulo farshaxanka','Add an episode'=>'Ku dar qayb','Choose audio file'=>'Dooro faylka maqalka','Replace audio file'=>'Beddel feylka maqalka','or its address'=>'ama cinwaankeeda','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Kudar qaybaha dhinaca.','Author box'=>'Sanduuqa qoraaga','Profile picture'=>'Sawirka astaanta profile-ka','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Cabbirka sawirka (pixels)','Biography'=>'Taariikh nololeedka','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Kuxir xiriirka qoraallada qoraaga','Link to their website'=>'Ku xir xiriiriyaha shabakadooda','Name as'=>'Magaca oo ah','Heading 2'=>'Cinwaan 2','Heading 3'=>'Madax 3','Heading 4'=>'Madax 4','Paragraph'=>'Baasqad','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Qoraaga qoraalka ayaa halkan ka muuqda.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Akhriyayaasha shaashadda ayaa akhriya, waana la tusiyaa marka “Muuji sumadda” shidanto.','Show label'=>'Muuji sumadda','Corner'=>'Geeska','End (right in English)'=>'Dhammaad (midig ku taal Ingiriisiga)','Start (left in English)'=>'Bilow (bidix ku reeb Ingiriisi)','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Ka muuqdo marka la soo rogto (pixels)','Before: alternative text'=>'Kahor: qoraal beddel ah','Before: label'=>'Ka hor: label','After: alternative text'=>'Kadib: qoraalka beddelka ah','After: label'=>'Ka dib:','Slider'=>'Kabaha xulashada','Starting position (%)'=>'Meelka bilowga (%)','Before and after'=>'Ka hor iyo kadib','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'Xulo labada sawir ee ku jira dejinta baloogga. Isticmaal sawirro cabbirkoodu leeg yahay.','Start with the home page'=>'Ka bilow bogga hoyga','Home page label'=>'Calaamadda bogga hoose','Separator'=>'Kala-soocaha','Chevron ›'=>'Chevron ›','Slash /'=>'Slash /','Arrow →'=>'Gocondho →','Dot ·'=>'Barta ·','End with the current page'=>'Ku dhaji bogga hadda jira','Structured data for search engines'=>'Macluumaadka habaysan ee mashiinnada raadinta','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'Waxay ku dareysaa xogta BreadcrumbList bogga. Demi haddii qalabka SEO uu horay u daray xogta breadcrumb.','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'Wadada bogga hadda la joogo ayaa halkan ka muuqata. Bogga gurigu ma laha mid.','From'=>'Laga bilaabo','To'=>'Ilaa','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Ka saar saacadahan %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ku dar saacadaha (nasashada)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Ka guuri Isniinta ilaa Isniin–Jimco','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Saacadaha ku eg dhexda habeenkii wixii ka dambeeya (18:00 ilaa 02:00) waxay ka tirsan yihiin maalinta ay billowdaan. Waqtiyadu waxay ku jiraan aagga waqtiga ee bogga (Settings › General).','Display'=>'So bandhig','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Madhan: akhriya oo kaliya akhristayaasha shaashadda.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Sheeg inuu haatan furan yahay','Highlight today'=>'Muuji maanta','Note under the hours'=>'Fiiro gaar ah oo ku hoos taal saacadaha','Closed on public holidays.'=>'Waxa ay xiran tahay maalmaha fasaxa qaranka.','Offers'=>'Dalabyada','Add an offer'=>'Ku dar dalab','New offer'=>'Dalab cusub','Table'=>'Miiska','Caption'=>'Cinwaan-hoosaad','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyay miiska kore, waxaana akhriya qalabka wax akhriya.','Rank column'=>'Kolanka darajada','Rating column'=>'Iftiinka qiimeynta','Highlights column'=>'Kolonka ugu muhiimsan','Notice under the table'=>'Ogeysiiska ku jira miiska hoostiisa','Casino comparison table'=>'Smijaalka isbarbardhiga kaniinooyinka','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Ku dar dalabyada dhinaca bidix ama midig, kuwa ugu fiican marka hore.','Kind'=>'Nooc','Bars'=>'Baarro','Line'=>'Safka','Pie (first series only)'=>'Keydka (taxanaha koowaad oo keliya)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'Waxaa lagu tusiyaa shaxda kore oo loona akhriyaa magaceeda.','Before each value'=>'Qiimaha kasta ka hor','For example $ or €.'=>'Tusaale ahaan $ ama €.','After each value'=>'Qiime kasta kadib','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Tusaale ahaan kg, ama calaamadda boqolleyda.','Show a legend'=>'Muuji hal-abuurka','Print each value on the chart'=>'Qiime kasta ku daabac jaantuska','Height'=>'Dhererka','Short'=>'Gaaban','Tall'=>'Dheer','Add categories and numbers below to draw the chart.'=>'Ku dar qaybaha iyo nambarada hoose si aad u sawirto shaxanka.','Add category'=>'Ku dar qayb','Add series'=>'Ku dar taxane','Click to share quote'=>'Guji si aad u wadaagto oraahda','Quote'=>'Oraah','X username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha ee X','Added as "via @name". Without the @.'=>'Waxaa lagu daray "via @name". Iyada oo aan la isticmaalin @.','Link to share'=>'Xiriirka la wadaagayo','Left empty, the address of this page.'=>'Haddii la tago madhan, cinwaanka boggan.','Write the quote in the block settings.'=>'Ku qor oraahda dejinta baloogga.','Content switcher'=>'Beddelaha nuxurka','Name for screen readers'=>'Magaca akhriyayaasha shaashadda','What the switch chooses, for example "Billing period".'=>'Waxa ay badalku dooranayso, tusaale ahaan "Muddada biilasha".','Add an option'=>'Ku dar ikhtiyaar','Countdown'=>'Tirinta hoos u dhaca ah','Count down to'=>'Xisaabi ilaa','A date and time'=>'Taariikh iyo saacad','A time after each visitor arrives'=>'Waqti ka dib marka booqde kasta yimaado','Ends at'=>'Wuxuu ku eegyahay','In the time zone set under Settings, General.'=>'Waqtiga deegaanka ee lagu dejiyay Settings, General.','Hours after the first visit'=>'Saacado ka dib booqashadii ugu horeysay','Text above'=>'Qoraalka sare','Text once it has ended'=>'Qoraalku markii uu dhammaaday','Show seconds'=>'Muuji ilbiriqsiyada','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Dooro taariikhda iyo waqtiga ay tirada hoos u dhacayaan ku eg yihiin.','Counter'=>'Tiriye','Count to'=>'Ku tiriso illaa','Count from'=>'Ka bilow','Decimal places'=>'Meelaha jajanka','Before the number'=>'Nambarka ka hor','For example "$".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "$".','After the number'=>'Lambarka kadib','For example "+" or "%".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "+" ama "%".','Thousands separator'=>'Kala-sooca kumanaanleyda','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'Waqtiga tirinta (miliyisiriq)','Set the number to count to.'=>'Deji tirada lagu tirinayo.','Coupon code'=>'Koodka rasiidhka ah','Description'=>'Sharaxaadda','Expires'=>'Wuu dhacayaa','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Sida aad rabto in loo tuso, tusaale ahaan "31 December".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Geli koodhka goobaha baloogga.','Prices'=>'Qiimaha','Show as'=>'Soo bandhig sida','Scrolling ticker'=>'Qoraalka duulaya','Cards'=>'Kaararka','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Shaxda qiimaha (hal lacag)','Period'=>'Muddo','24 hours'=>'24 saacadood','7 days'=>'7 maalmood','30 days'=>'30 maalmood','90 days'=>'90 maalmood','Currency'=>'Lacagta','Coins'=>'Lacagta birta ah','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Qiimaha waxaa laga helayaa CoinGecko waxaana lagu hayaa bartaada dhowr daqiiqadood, markaa booqdayaasheedu waligood ma sugaan.','Crypto prices'=>'Qiimaha Crypto','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Ka dooro shilinada dhinaca.','Cursor effect'=>'Saamaynta dul-maraha','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Giraan ayaa raacaya tilmaamaha','A soft spotlight'=>'Iftiinka jilicsan ee diiradda saaran','A trail of dots'=>'Raad dhibco ah','Where'=>'Halkee','Over this section'=>'Qaybtan korkeeda','Over the whole page'=>'Bogga oo dhan','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Calaamadaha dhabta ah mar walba waa ay haysanayaan. Saamayntu waa ay ka damsan tahay shaashadaha taabashada iyo booqdayaasha aaladdooda ka codsada hughaq yar.','Switch'=>'Beddel','Number'=>'Lambarka','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Kani ma laha safaf oo ka hooseeya sadarkiisa koowaad. Sadarka koowaad waxaa loo isticmaalaa magacyada tiirarka.','Import a CSV file'=>'Soo dejiso fayl CSV ah','Or paste CSV'=>'Ama dhaji CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Comma, semicolon ama tab ayaa lagu kala saaray. Safka koowaad wuxuu hayaa magacyada tiirarka. Soo dejintu waxay bedelaysaa jadwalka.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Soo deji CSV-ga la dhajiyay','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Wuxuu sheegayaa waxa ay miisku tusinayo. Akhristayaasha shaashaddu way ku dhawaaqaan xitaa marka ay shaashadda ka madhan tahay.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Booqdawayaashu waxay u kala saari karaan tiir ahaan','Show a search field'=>'Muuji goobta raadinta','First column names each row'=>'Safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabayaa saf kasta','Sort “%s” as'=>'U kala sooc “%s” sida','Remove column'=>'Ka saar tiirka','Import CSV'=>'Soo dejiso CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'Shaashad cidhiidhi ah','Each row becomes a card'=>'Saf маستا kasta waxay noqotaa kaarka','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Miiska wuxuu u guuraa dhinac','Striped rows'=>'Safafka xariiqda leh','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste one, or start with an empty table.'=>'Soo geli xaashida faafinta oo ah CSV, dheji mid, ama ku bilow shax eber ah.','Start with an empty table'=>'Miiska madhan ka bilow','Name of column %d'=>'Magaca tiirka %d','Row %1$d, %2$s'=>'Safka %1$d, %2$s','Remove row %d'=>'Ka saar safka %d','Events'=>'Dhacdooyinka','Add an event'=>'Ku dar dhacdo','Starts'=>'Bilowda','In the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Aagga wakhtiga ee bogga (Dejinta › Guud ahaan).','Ends (optional)'=>'Dhamaadka (ikhtiyaari)','Web address (optional)'=>'Cinwaanka shabakadda (ikhtiyaari)','Tickets or details. The title links to it.'=>'Tikidhada ama tafaasiisha. Ciwaanku wuxuu ku xidhiidhaa.','All day'=>'Maalinta oo dhan','A list'=>'Liis','A month calendar'=>'Bisha kalandarka','Keep past events'=>'Hayso dhacdooyinkii hore','Off: an event leaves the page once it has ended.'=>'Dami: dhacdadu waxay ka tagaysaa bogga marka ay dhammaato.','Add the first event in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar dhacdada koowaad dhinaca bidix ee bar-tilmaameedka.','Front'=>'Hore','Button link'=>'Iskuxiraha badhanka','Flip box'=>'Sanduuqa rogista','Flip'=>'Gadoomi','Write the front and the back in the block settings.'=>'Gali dhinaca hore iyo dhabarka dejinta baloogga.','Loading lists…'=>'Liisaska ayaa la soo dejinayaa…','List'=>'Liiska','Choose a list'=>'Dooro liiska','Your name'=>'Magacaaga','Form name'=>'Magaca foomka','Shown in the email subject and the submissions list.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyay mawduuca iimeeylka iyo liiska gudbinta.','Message after sending'=>'Farriinta la diro kadib','Go to this page after sending (optional)'=>'Tagada boggan kadib dirista (ikhtiyaari)','Conversion event (optional)'=>'Munaasabadda beddelka (ikhtiyaari)','Sent to Google Analytics, Tag Manager and the Meta Pixel when the form is sent. Leave empty for the default (generate_lead).'=>'Markabka marka la diro waxaa loo diraa Google Analytics, Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel. Madhan uga tag wixii caadiga ah (generate_lead).','After sending'=>'Ka dib marka la dirto','Email the submission'=>'U dir iimayl gudbinta','Send to'=>'U dir ku','One or more addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site administrator.'=>'Mid ama in ka badan ciwaanno, oo ay kala soocayaan faallooyin. Madhan: maamulaha mareegta.','Save submissions on this site'=>'Ku kaydi gudbinta bishan saytkan','Listed under Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, with a CSV export.'=>'Waxaa lagu taxay hoosta Page Builder Sandwich → Form s