aha cawl','Lottie animation'=>'Animations Lottie','Animation file chosen.'=>'Faylka animations-ka waa la doortay.','Upload or choose an animation file in the block settings.'=>'Geli ama dooro faylka animation-ka ah ee ku jira dejinta baloogga.','The file could not be uploaded.'=>'Faylka laguma soo gelin karo.','Animation file'=>'Faylka animations-ka','— Choose —'=>'— Dooro —','Upload a Lottie file (.json)'=>'Geli faylka Lottie (.json)','Playback'=>'Daarista','What the animation shows, for people who cannot see it.'=>'Waxa animations-ku muujinayaan, dadka aan arki karin.','Play'=>'Ciyaar','When it scrolls into view'=>'Markuu shaashadda soo galo','As soon as the page loads'=>'Isla marka boggu soo dhaafo','While the pointer is over it'=>'Inta uu tilmaamuhu dul joogo','Loop'=>'Wareeg','Marquee'=>'Marquee','Moves'=>'Gudubyada','Towards the start of a line'=>'Dhanka bilowga safka','Towards the end of a line'=>'Dhamaadka sadarka ku dhow','Between items'=>'Waxyaabaha dhexdooda ah','Nothing'=>'Waxba ma jiraan','Name read out by screen readers'=>'Magaca ay akhriyaan qalabka akhriska shaashadda','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Booqdayaashu waxay helayaan badhan joojin ah, wuuna istaagaa marka ay tilmaamaan. Wuu taagnaanayaa booqdayaasha codsada dhaqaaq yar.','Item %d'=>'Shayga %d','Remove item %d'=>'Ka saar shayga %d','Add item'=>'Ku dar shayga','Mega menu'=>'Liiska weyn','Show under'=>'Muuji hoos-ahaad','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Curiyaha menu-ga ee heerka sare ah ee furaya guddigan.','Choose an item…'=>'Dooro shay…','As wide as its content'=>'Isku ballaaran inta uu le’eg yahay waxa ku jira','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Sida liiska menu-ga oo kale','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Mega menu ee "%s"','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Menu-ga weyn: ka dooro shayga menu-ga dhinaca bidix.','Phones'=>'Teleefannada','Accordion on phones'=>'Akodiyonka taleefannada','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'Shaashadaha cidhiidhiga ah, tab kasta waxay noqotaa qayb si madaxbannaan u furanta oo u xirmta.','3D model'=>'Qaabka 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Dooro nooc (GLB ama glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Sharaxaad (looga baahan yahay)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Waxa tusaalku tusayo: waa waxa uu akhristaha shaashaddu ku dhawaaqayo.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Sawirka boorarka ee la muujiyo inta uu soo dejisanayo','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Si tartiib ah ayay u wareegtaa keligeed','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Bixi "ku fiirso booskaaga" (AR) taleefannada','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Dooro qaab-dhismeed 3D ah dhinaca dhinac.','Choose a menu…'=>'Dooro menu…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Kaliya dadka wax ka bedeli kara menu-yada mareegta ayaa mid ka dooran kara halkan.','Navigation menu'=>'Liiska navigation-ka','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Dooro liiska WordPress ee la tusayo.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Boggan wali ma laha wax menu ah. Mid abuur, kadibna halkaan ka dooro.','Edit menus'=>'Tirsooyinka menu-ga','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Waxay u sheegtaa isticmaaleyaasha akhriyaha shaashadda liiska uu yahay, tusaale ahaan "Weyn" ama "Hoose".','Direction'=>'Jihoofada','In a row'=>'Shax saf','In a column'=>'Isku tiir','Mobile menu button'=>'Badhanka liiska mobilka','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Ballacaan kan ka hooseeya menu-gu wuxuu u laabmaa badhan furaya b bogga dushiisa.','On phones'=>'Telefoonada','On phones and tablets'=>'Teleefannada iyo kiniiniyada','Always'=>'Mar walba','Never'=>'Weligaa','Open submenus'=>'Furo hoos-hoos-liiska','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Markabka la gujiyo','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'Marka la dul maro, ama marka fallaarta la gujiyo','Mega menus'=>'Liisaska Mega','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Menu-ga mega wuxuu muujinayaa wax kasta oo block ah oo hoos yimaada shay heer sare ah, halkii uu ka ahaan lahaa submenu-giisa. Ku dar baal hoos yimaada menu-ga oo dooro shaygiisa.','“%s” has a mega menu.'=>'“%s” waxay leedahay menu aad u weyn.','Add a mega menu panel'=>'Ku dar qaybta menu-ga weyn','Saved.'=>'La kaydiyay.','Mailchimp API key'=>'Furaha API ee Mailchimp','A key ending in %s is saved for the whole site.'=>'Fure ku dhammaanaya %s ayaa loogu keydiyay mareegaha oo dhan.','No key is saved yet: the form will not appear on the page until one is.'=>'Lama keydiyo wax furaha ah weli: foomku kama muuqan doono bogga ilaa mid la keydiyo mooyee.','New key'=>'Furaha cusub','Save key'=>'Keydso furaha','Remove key'=>'Ka saar furaha','Only an administrator can change it.'=>'Kaliya maamule ayaa bedeli kara.','Send signups to'=>'U dir diiwaangelinta','List ID'=>'Liiska Aqoonsiga','MailPoet: the list number. Mailchimp: the audience ID. AWeber: the list name.'=>'MailPoet: lambarka liiska. Mailchimp: ID-ga dhageystayaasha. AWeber: magaca liiska.','Wording'=>'Eray-bixin','Heading'=>'Madax','Consent box'=>'Sanduuqa oggolaanshaha','Visitors must tick it to subscribe. Say what they will receive.'=>'Booqdayeyaashu waa inay saxaan si ay u diiwaan-geliyaan. Sheeg waxa ay heli doonaan.','Message after signing up'=>'Farriinta ka dib is-diiwaangelinta','Stacked'=>'Isku-daran','Address and button on one line'=>'Cinwaanka iyo badhanka hal sadar','Newsletter signup'=>'Diiwaangelinta wargeyska','Choose the service and enter the list ID (and, for Mailchimp, the API key) in the block settings.'=>'Adeegga dooro oo geli aqoonsiga liiska (iyo, Mailchimp, furaha API) goobaha xannibaadda.','Offer'=>'Dalab','Logo and link'=>'Summaddu iyo xiriiriyaha','Under a heading of its own, choose t