ry','Cards of different heights, packed into columns.'=>'Kaararka dhererka kala duwan leh, ee ku jira tiirar.','Filterable portfolio'=>'Portefooliyada la sifti karo','Cards with category buttons that filter them.'=>'Kaararka leh badhamada qaybaha oo sifeeya.','Items'=>'Alaabaha','Add an item'=>'Ku dar shay','Price'=>'Qiimaha','Price list'=>'Liiska qiimaha','Add an item in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar shay goobaha baloogga.','Plans'=>'Qorshayaasha','Add a plan'=>'Ku dar qorshe','Plan name'=>'Magaca qorshaha','Short description'=>'Sharaxaad kooban','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Tirada sida 19 ama 19.99, ama erey sida Bilaash.','After the price'=>'Qiimaha ka dib','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Tusaale ahaan "/ bilkii". Haddii la tago meel bannaan, xilliga biilasha ayaa la isticmaalaa.','Yearly price'=>'Qiimaha sannadlaha ah','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'Waxaa la muujiyaa marka booqashadu ay u beddesho biilasha sanadlaha ah.','After the yearly price'=>'Qiimaha sannadlaha ah kadib','Add a feature'=>'Ku dar sifo','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Fur xiriiriyaha tab cusub','Highlight this plan'=>'Muuji qorshahaan','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Calaamad gaaban oo ka sarraysa qorshaha, sida "Aad loo jecel yahay".','Pricing table'=>'Miiska qiimaha','Currency symbol'=>'Lacagta astaankeeda','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Beddelka bilaha / sanadlaha','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Waxay tusaysaa beddel (switch) marka ugu yaraan hal qorshe uu leeyahay qiime sanadle ah.','Monthly button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka bilaha ah','Yearly button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka sannadlaha ah','Yearly saving'=>'Kaydinta sannadlaha ah','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "Kaydi 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Goobaha baloogga ku dar qorshe.','Out of'=>'Ka mid ah','A percentage'=>'Boqolley','The value out of the total'=>'Qiimaha guud ka 