,'Help link'=>'Xiriirka caawinta','Show the age badge'=>'Muuji sumadaha da\'da','Link the national help service'=>'Ku xidh adeegga caawinta qaranka','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Soo-boqdayaasha ka timaada UK, US, Australia, Germany, France iyo Sweden, ku xidh adeega caawimada ee dalkaas. Ka dhuux shatigaaga si aad u hubiso, dalka kale ee ku xigana hoos ku dar.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Ogeysiiska khamaarka mas\'uuliyadda leh','The notice shows here.'=>'Ogeysiiska ayaa halkan ka muuqda.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Tusaale ahaan “Q3 2026” ama “Guga”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Looxa: la qorsheeyay, socda, la dhammeeyey','One list, each item with its status'=>'Hal liis, shay kastaana wuxuu leeyahay xaaladdiisa','Column heading level'=>'Heerka madaxa tiirka','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar shayga koowaad ee dhinaca.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Calaamadaha qarsoon ayaa weli ay akhriyaan qalabka akhriska shaashadda.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Astaan oo aan ahayn qoraalka badhanka','Search in'=>'Ka raadi dhexda','The whole website'=>'Websaydhka oo dhan','Device share menu'=>'Liiska wadaagista qalabka','Share to'=>'La wadaag','Share bar'=>'Aagga la wadaago','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Tusaale ahaan "Wadaag". Haddii la banneeyo, wax sumad ah laguma tusi doono.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Dhinaca ayuu ka sabeynayaa (shaashadaha ballaaran)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Badhannadu waxay soo baxayaan marka boggu leeyahay cinwaan (u keydi sidii qabyo ahaan).','Networks'=>'Shabakadaha','Device share button'=>'Badhanka wadaagga qalabka','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Telefoonnada iyo qaar ka mid ah biraawsarrada ayaa bixiya xaashidooda wadaagista; badhankuna wuxuu muuqdaa halka mid uu ka jiro oo keliya.','Look'=>'Eeg','Show network names'=>'Muuji magacyada shabakadda','Shape'=>'Qaabka','Rounded'=>'Wareegsan','Circle'=>'Wareeg','Square'=>'Iskār','Edit images (%d)'=>'Wax ka beddel sawirada (%d)','Choose images'=>'Dooro sawirrada','Content type'=>'Nooca waxa ku jira','Items per page'=>'Shandad kasta boggiiba','Only these categories'=>'Keliya qaybahaan','None chosen: every category.'=>'Mid lama dooran: dhammaan qaybaha.','Oldest first'=>'Ugu da-daʼda ah marka hore','Title, A to Z'=>'Cinwaan, A ilaa Z','Recently updated'=>'Dhawaan la cusboonaysiiyay','Custom order'=>'Dalab caadi ah','Random'=>'Rakaabka ah','Summary'=>'So koobsho','Price (products)'=>'Qiimaha (alaabta)','Card'=>'Kaarka','Previous and next buttons'=>'Badhamada hore iyo xiga','Start again after the last'=>'Ka bilow mar kale ka dib kan ugu dambeeya','Play automatically'=>'Si toos ah u ciyaar','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Marna looma muujiyo booqdayaasha doorbida dhaqaaq yar; wuu hakadaa marka la dul istaago ama diiradda la saaro, wuxuuna leeyahay badhan Jooji.','Seconds per slide'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo halkii bog','Move up'=>'Kor u rari','Move down'=>'Hoos u dhaqaaji','Remove column %s'=>'Ka saar tiirka %s','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Safafka koowaad waxay hayaan magacyada tiirarka. Soo dejintu waxay beddeshaa waxa halkan yaal.','Remove image'=>'Ka saar sawirka','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Dooro heerka ku habboon dulucda bogga.','Replace photo'=>'Beddel sawirka','Move %s up'=>'U qaado %s kor','Move %s down'=>'U dhaaji %s hoos','Duplicate %s'=>'Nuqul ka dhig %s','Remove %s'=>'Ka saar %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Qiimeyn (0 ilaa 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Tilmaamaha muhiimka ah, midkiiba safar','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Ikhtiyaari ah, tusaale ahaan “Xulashada ugu sarreysa”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Shuruudaha (oo la tusay dalabka)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Erayada muhiimka ah ee uu liisanku kaa doonayo agagaarka dalabka, tusaale ahaan shuruudaha sharadka.','Replace logo'=>'Bedel astaanta','Choose logo'=>'Xulo astaamaha','Remove logo'=>'Ka saar astaanta','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Sii xiriirka gaaban magac, oo dalabkana siiso ciwaan buuxda oo ka bilaabmaya https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Xiriiriyaha gaaban lama keydin karo.','Offer address'=>'Cinwaanka dalabka','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Xiriirkaaga xiriirinta. Xiriirinta dalabyada waxaa loo calaamadeeyaa si kafaala-qaad ah mashiinnada raadinta.','Go through a short link'=>'Muuji xiriiriye gaaban','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Booqtayaashu waxay goobtaada ku arkaan ciwaan gaaban, guji kastaana waa la tiriyaa gudaha Xiriiriyeyaasha gaaban.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Boqortooyada ayaa arki doonta %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Ama samee mid cusub, oo magacaabeysa','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Ka abuur xiriir gaaban cinwaanka','Height before the button'=>'Joogga ka hor badhanka','Button text when open'=>'Qoraalka badhanka marka uu furan yahay','Header'=>'Madax','Sticky'=>'Dhegaysan','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Wuxuu ku sugnaadaa dusha sare ee shaashadda inta ay soo booqdayaashu hoos u roogayaan.','Transparent'=>'Hufan','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Waxay dul saaran tahay qaybta koowaad ee bogga, waxayna qaadataa midabka asalka ah ee bogga marka boggu soo rogo. Sii qaybta koowaad meel ku filan xagga sare.','Slides come from'=>'Bogaggu waxay ka yimaadaan','Blocks I add'=>'Blocks aan daray','Posts'=>'Qoraallada','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Alaabooyinka (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Silibi','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (sawirro, zoom-ga tartiib ah)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Sawirrada shaashadda ee muuqda: desktop','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Bogagga muuqda: tablet','Slides in view: phone'=>'Bogagga muuqda: telefoonka','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Waxa ay bogaggu yihiin, tusaale ahaan "Sheekooyinka macaamiisha".','Image slider'=>'Bogga sawirrada siibaan','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Sawirrada laga soo qaaday maktabadda warbaahinta, midka kale ka dib.','Post slider'=>'Bogga wararka','Product slider'=>'Liiska badeecadda','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Alaabooyinka WooCommerce oo ah rog-rog (carousel).','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Bandhigga Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Sawirro buuxa oo leh zoom gaabis ah, oo midba kan kale ka dhex libdhayo.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Ogeysiisyada iibka ee dhowaan - tusaale, oo lagu tusay kaliya tifaftiraha','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Magaca koowaad ee ka yimid Town wuxuu iibsaday Product','2 hours ago'=>'2 saacadood ka hor','Orders'=>'Dalabyada','Orders from'=>'Dalabyada ka yimid','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce iyo Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Dalabyadii ugu dambeeyay ee la tusayo','Oldest order (days)'=>'Dalabka ugu da\'da weyn (maalmo)','Name the product'=>'U magac bixi badeecadda','Say how long ago'=>'Sheeg inta ay ka dambayso waqtigii hore','Timing and place'=>'Wakhtiga iyo goobta','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Ogeysiis kasta wuxuu muuqdaa (seconds)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Hakanka ogaysiisyada (ilbiriqsi)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Hoose, akhriska bilowga','Bottom, reading end'=>'Dhamaadka hoose','Where the notices come from'=>'Halk ay ogeysiisyada ka yimaadaan','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Kaliya dalabaadka dhabta ah ee la bixiyay ayaa la tusaa, waana marka iibsaduhu uu calaamadiyo sanduuqa xilliga lacag-bixinta ee u oggolaanaya boggan inuu muujiyo magaca koowaad iyo magaalada. Marka boggan la keydiyo, xulashada lacag-bixintu waxay bixisaa sanduuqaas. Ilaa inta dalab leh uu ka imaanayo, booqdayaashu wax ma arkaan.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Ka hel isku-duweyasha cinwaanka','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'La helay. Hubi biinka ku yaala khariidadda bogga.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Wax natiijo ah ma jiro. Isku day wadada, degmada iyo lambarka boostada, ama geli isku-duwayasha.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap wax celisay ma aha. Mar labaad isku day daqiiqad ka dib, ama qor isku-duwayasha.','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Waxay cinwaanka u diraysaa OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) waxayna buuxinaysaa loolanka iyo loolanka.','Locations'=>'Goobaha','Add a location'=>'Ku dar goob','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Raadi iyo “Ka iugu dhow aniga”','Offer a map'=>'Bixiy khariidad','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Booqdayeyaashu waxay marka hore riixaan "Muuji khariidadda": waxna kama soo rarto OpenStreetMap ilaa ay sidaas sameeyaan.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Khariidadda weyneynteeda (0 = ku dar dhammaan goobaha)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar goobta ugu horreysa dhinaca bidix.','Pane'=>'Daaqadaha','Name on the switch'=>'Magaca ku yaalla beddelaha','Person'=>'Qofka','Short bio'=>'Taariikh kooban','Photo'=>'Sawirka','Photo: alternative text'=>'Sawir: qoraalka beddelka ah','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Bannaan kaga tag marka ay sawirku kaliya ku celinayso magaca.','Profile links'=>'Xiriiriyeyaasha astaanta','Add a link'=>'Ku dar xiriiriye','Network'=>'Shabakad','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar qof goobaha baloogga.','Event'=>'Dhacdo','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar dhacdo dejinta baloogga.','Badges'=>'Calaamadaha','Add a badge'=>'Ku dar sumad','Trust badges'=>'Calaamadaha kalsoonida','Row'=>'Saf','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Dejinta baloogga ku dar calaamad.','Videos'=>'Fiidiyowyada','Add a video'=>'Ku dar muuqaal','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Ciwaanka muuqaalka (YouTube, Vimeo ama fayl)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Sawirka xayaysiiska (ikhtiyaari)','Replace poster'=>'Beddel boodhka','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar fiidiyowyo dhinaca geeska ah.','Name of the list'=>'Magaca liiska','Web address or text'=>'Cinwaanka shabakadda ama qoraalka','QR code'=>'Koodka QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Sharaxaadda akhriska shaashadda','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'U daab ban si aad u isticmaasho "QR code for" iyo qoraalka.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Ku qor cinwaanka shabakadda, xiriirinta taleefanka (tel:) ama qoraal kasta.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Tani aad bay ugu dheer tahay code-ka QR-ka. Gaabi.','Add a caption'=>'Ku dar faallo','Reading progress bar'=>'Baarka horumarka akhriska','Edge of the window'=>'Daaqadda geeskeeda','Top'=>'Sare','Bottom'=>'Hoose','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyaa xagga hoose ee daaqadda marka booqdayaashu ay hoos u rolaan bogga.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyaa xagga sare ee daaqadda sida booqdayaashu u dhex-rogayaan.','Related by'=>'Waxay xiriir la leedahay','Categories or tags'=>'Qeybaha ama calaamadaha','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Marka aanay jirin wax la xiriira, tus kan ugu cusub beddelkeeda','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'U daa madhan "Qoraallada la xiriira".','Show the featured image'=>'Muuji sawirka la soo xulay','Show a summary'=>'Muuji soo koobitaan','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Ma jiraan qoraallo wadaaga qaybaha ama calaamadaha qoraalkan weli. Marka ay qaar yimaadaan, waxay ka muuqdaan halkan.','Modal'=>'Daaqadda wada-sheekaysiga','Off-canvas panel'=>'Guddiga ka baxsan bogga','Slides in from'=>'Wuxuu ka soo sibxanaa','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Bilowgu waa dhinaca ay akhrisku ka bilaabmaan: midigta carabiga, bidixda Ingiriiska.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Xir marka bogga dambe la gujiyo','Title of the window'=>'Ciwaanka daaqadda','Check mark'=>'Calaamadda saxda','Cross'=>'Gudubka','Dot'=>'Dhibic','Arrow'=>'Gacmeed','Star'=>'Xiddig','Icon colour'=>'Midabka astaanta','Same as the text'=>'Sidii qoraalka oo kale','Theme primary'=>'Mowduuca koowaad','Theme secondary'=>'Mawduuca labaad','Theme contrast'=>'Midabka mawduuca','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Madaxyada ku hay nidaamka bogga hoostiisa: madax heerkiisu hooseeyo qaybta uu ku jiro.','Choose icon'=>'Xullo astaamaha','Use the default icon'=>'Isticmaal astaanta caadiga ah','Choose an icon'=>'Xulo astaamaha','Show a heading for each type'=>'Muuji cinwaan nooc kasta','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Ma jiro wax la daabacay oo ku jira noocyada aad dooratay.','Links'=>'Xiriiriyeyaasha','Link %d'=>'Xiriiriyaha %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Cinwaanka astaanta, mailto:you@example.com ama tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Magaca loo akhriyo akhristayaasha shaashadda','Other icon'=>'Calaamad kale','Add link'=>'Ku dar xiriiriye','Icon only'=>'Summaddaha kaliya','Rounded square'=>'Wareeg geesood ah','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Fur astaamaha cusub','Star rating'=>'Heerka xiddigaha','Number of stars'=>'Xidigaha tiradaoda','Show the number'=>'Tirada tus','Down the page'=>'Bogga hoos u deg','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Isbarbar dhig (waxay is dul saaraan telefoonnada)','Number colour'=>'Midabka lambarka','Order of the steps'=>'Tallaabooyinka kala sarraysa','Step %d'=>'Tallaabada %d','Step…'=>'Tallaabada…','What to do…'=>'Maxaa la samaynayaa…','Add step'=>'Ku dar tallaabo','Tab'=>'Tabka','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Ku dar madaxyada bogga waxaana lagu taxli doonaa halkan.','Table of contents'=>'Aruuriyaha tusmada','From heading level'=>'Ka bilaabaya heerka cinwaanka','To heading level'=>'Isku xigxiga madaxyada','Numbered'=>'Tiroobay','Can be collapsed'=>'Waa la soo koobi karaa','Start collapsed'=>'Bilow la duubay','Highlight the section being read'=>'Muuji qaybta la akhrinayo','Tabs'=>'Tabosyada','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Ikhtiyaari ah. Waxay sheegaysaa waxa ay tabs-ku ku saabsan yihiin, tusaale ahaan "Qorshayaasha".','Open on page load'=>'Fur marka uu boggu soo rarto','Tabs down the side'=>'Tabs-ka dhinaca hoos u socda','Add a tab'=>'Ku dar tab','Testimonial'=>'Markhaati-fur','Choose photo'=>'Sawir dooro','Remove photo'=>'Ka saar sawirka','Photo description'=>'Sharaxaada sawirka','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'U daadi madhan marka uu sawirku tusi karo oo keliya qofka magaciisu ku xiga yahay.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Qioraha xiddigaha (0 = ma jiro)','Name under the quote'=>'Magaca hoostiisa xigashada','Photo beside the quote'=>'Sawirka ku xiga oraahda','What the customer said…'=>'Waxa macmiilku yiri…','Role or company'=>'Doorka ama shirkadda','Tooltip'=>'Qalab-tilmaameed','Tooltip text'=>'Qoraalka caawiyaha','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Ka dhig mid gaaban: hal ama laba weedhood. Shaashad-akhrisiyeyaasha waxay ku akhriyaan erayga ay sharxayso.','Show it'=>'Muuji','Above'=>'Sare','Below'=>'Hoose','Word or phrase'=>'Eray ё 3 eray-yar','Apply'=>'Codso','Profile'=>'Xogta koontada','Whose profile'=>'Qofka xisaabtiisa','The post’s author'=>'Qoraaga qoraalka','Show the profile picture'=>'Muuji sawirka astaanta','Show the biography'=>'Muuji taariikh nololeedka','Show links to posts and website'=>'Muuji xiriiriyeyaasha qoraallada iyo barta internetka','Author profile'=>'Qoraaga astaantiisa','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Dooro cidda profile-keeda la tusayo.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Lambarka WhatsApp, oo ay ku jirto koodhka dalka','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Tusaale ahaan +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Fariinta lagu bilaabayo (ikhtiyaari)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Muuji qoraalka ag yaal astaanta','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Dhamaadka hoose (midig ee Ingiriiska)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Gunta hoose (bidix ku yaal Ingiriiska)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ku dar lambarkaaga WhatsApp dhinaca dhinaca. Ilaa intaas badhanka looma tusayo bogga.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Boggan, badhankani wuxuu ku sabbaynayaa geeska hoose ee shaashadda.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'Waxaa lagu keydiyay maktabaddaada daruuriga ah.','Save to cloud library'=>'Ku keydi maktabadda daruuraha','Save to'=>'Ku kaydi salka','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Sawirrada waa la beddelaa cabbirkooda, hal mar ayaana la keydiyaa waxaana dib loogu soo celiyaa maktabadda warbaahinta ee bog kasta oo geliya nashqaddan.','%s style'=>'%s qaabka','Save style to cloud library'=>'Keydi qaabka maktabadda daruuraha','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Markow hora u dooro, kadibna ku dabaq qaabka.','Library'=>'Maktabadda','Save this page to the library'=>'Kaydi boggan maktabadda','Insert'=>'Geli','Shortcode tag'=>'Astaamaha gaaban','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Isticmaal xarfaha, nambarada, xariijimaha iyo hoosta ka xarriiqaha kaliya.','Attribute name'=>'Magaca sifada','Add attribute'=>'Ku dar sifada','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Other attributes'=>'Sifooyinka kale','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Ka dooro calaamadda gaaban goobaha baloogga.','Image size'=>'Cabbirka sawirka','Thumbnail'=>'Sawir yar','Full size'=>'Cabirka buuxa','Link to'=>'Ku xirnow','Attachment page'=>'Bogga lifaaqa','Media file'=>'Fayisha warbaahinta','Audio'=>'Maqal','Video'=>'Muuqaal','File address'=>'Ciwaanka faylka','Poster image'=>'Muqaalka boodhka','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Aqoonsiyada Warbaahinta, oo ay kala saarayaan hakad','Show the track list'=>'Muuji liiska raadka','Embed'=>'Geli','Address to embed'=>'Ciwaanka la gelinayo','Maximum width'=>'Ballaca ugu badan','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML-ka sawirka iyo qoraalka hoose','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Talo: Xannibaanka foomku wuxuu tusiyaa foomkan oo loo qaabeeyey si uu u waafaqo mareegtaada.','Show the form title'=>'Muuji cinwaanka foomka','Show the form description'=>'Muuji sharaxaafta foomka','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Gudbi adigoon dib u shubin bogga','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Kontoroolka "%s" ee tifaftiraha hore looga heli maayo tifaftiraha baloogga. Geli qiimaha sidoo kale qoraal ahaan.','Choose file'=>'Xulo faylka','— Default —'=>'— Caadi ah —','Advanced styling'=>'Qaabeynta horumarsan','Inline CSS'=>'CSS-ka gudaha ah','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Go\'aannada CSS, tusaale ahaan: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Saamaynta (noocyadii hore)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Magacyada saamaynta ee bannaan-u-kala-baxsan ee laga soo qaaday noocyadii hore, tusaale ahaan: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Ballac buuxa, nuxurka waxaa lagu hayaa dhexda','Link relationship'=>'Xiriirka xiriirinta','Left'=>'Bidix','Right'=>'Midig','Add text…'=>'Ku dar qoraal…','Placement'=>'Meeseynta','On its own line'=>'Kala ah safkeeda','In the line, beside other content'=>'Safka dhexdiisa, oo ku xiga waxyaabaha kale','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Otomaatik ah (oo ku taal safkeeda gaarka ah ee heerka ugu sarreeya ee bogga)','Accessible label'=>'Summaddu la heli karo','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Astaamaha qurxinta uga tag eber.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Ka dooro sumad goobta dejinta baloogga.','New setting name'=>'Magaca dejinta cusub','For example: title or text'=>'Tusaale ahaan: cinwaan ama qoraal','Add setting'=>'Ku dar habeyn','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Xulo qalab yar','Widget area'=>'Goobta widget-ka','Choose a widget area'=>'Dooro aagagga farmaajada','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Sawirkan ma laha ballac iyo dherer, sidaas darteed boggu wuu boodi doonaa marka uu soo hogo. Sii ka dooro Maktabadda Warbaahinta (Media Library), ama dhig ballaciisa iyo dhererkiisa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Muuqaalkani kama iman Maktabadda Warbaahinta, markaa cabbirkiisu lama yaqaan oo boggu wuu boodi doonaa mark uu soo shubmayo. Beddelkeeda, geli Maktabadda Warbaahinta.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Muuqaal, fiiyo ama qaab ku jira HTML-kan malaha balac iyo dherer, marka boggu wuu boodayaa marka uu soo go\'ayo. Ku dar sifooyinka balaca iyo dhererka (width and height).','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kani wuxuu iskaba beddelaa cabbirka marka uu soo shubo, taas oo dhaqaajisa waxyaabaha hoostiisa ku yaal. Sii boos ama dhig hoose ee bogga.','Layout shift'=>'Isbeddelka qaab-dhismeedka','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Widget-kani ma qeexo dejintiisa, markaa waxaa loo tirtiraa sida magac iyo qiime lammaane ah.','Problem'=>'Dhibaato','Check'=>'Hubi','Show block'=>'Muuji baloogga','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Isticmaal midab mawduuc ah oo akhriska u fudud','Make it H%d'=>'Ka dhig H%d','Alt text'=>'Qoraalka kale ee beddelka ah','Save alt text'=>'Kaydi qoraalka beddelka ah','This image is decorative'=>'Sawirkani waa mid qurxin ah','Checking…'=>'La hubinayaa…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Ma jiraan dhibaatooyin helitaan ah oo laga helay boggan.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'%d dhibaato' . "\0" . '%d dhibaatooyin','%d thing to check'=>'%d shay oo la hubiyo' . "\0" . '%d shay oo la hubiyo','Check again'=>'Dib u hubi','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Baaritaanka tooska ah waxa uu helaa dhibaatooyin badan laakiin ma aha dhammaantood. Sidoo kale isku day bogga adoo isticmaalaya kiiboodhka keliya iyo akhriyaha shaashadda.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Midabka qoraalku waa %1$s:1; wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan %2$s:1 si loo akhriyi karo.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'guji halkan,halkan,wax badan akhri,wax badan,xiriiriye,xiriiriyahan,wax badan baro,tag','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Xiriiriyuhu ma laha qoraal, sidaa darteed akhriyaha shaashaduhu wuxuu ku dhawaaqaa oo keliya "xiriiriye". Ku dar qoraal ama calaamad.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha “%s” ma tilmaamayo meesha uu aado. Halkaas beddelkeeda sharax meesha loo socdo.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Curalee leh ayaa leh tabindex togan, taas oo beddeleysa nidaamka kiiboodhka oo ka fogeyneysa nidaamka akhriska. Isticmaal 0 ama ka saar.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Wax la guji karo lagama gaari karo kiiboodhka. Isticmaal badhan ama xiriiriye dhab ah.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Qeyb hoose ku jirta ma leh ciwaan, markaas akhriyaha shaashaduhu ma sheegi karo waxa ay tahay.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Foomka gelinta ma laha summad, sidaa darteed ujeedadiisa lama shaacinayo.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Madaxani wuu madhan yahay. Isticmaaleyaasha akhriyaha shaashaddu waxay ku dhex maraan madaxyada; ka saar ama ku dar qoraal.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Cinwaanka boggu horey ayuu u yahay H1; adeegso H2 heerka ugu sarreeya ee nuxurka.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'H%1$d Tani waxay ka boodaysaa hal heer; kii ka horreeyay wuxuu ahaa H%2$d. Ka dhig H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Sawirkani ma laha qoraal kale (alt text). Sifee, ama u calaamadee mid qurxin ah haddii uusan waxba ku kordhinayn.','Close panel'=>'Xir guddiga','Desktop'=>'Desktop','Default'=>'Caadi ah','Every track'=>'Jidad kasta','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Cabirrada raadraaca, tusaale ahaan: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Cabirrada dabaqyada ee gaarka ah','Equal tracks'=>'Gawaari siman','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Safka mid walba oo lagu xidhay xigasho halkii safba, tusaale ahaan: "head head" "side main". Magacaw aagga ku yaal xannibaad kasta oo carruur ah.','Automatic'=>'Otomatik ah','Square (1:1)'=>'Garaab (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Caadiga ah (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Dhaqameed (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Ballaran (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Dheer (9:16)','Custom'=>'Gaar ah','Width / height'=>'Ballaca / Joogugga','Background image'=>'Sawirka asalka ah','Inherited image — replace'=>'Sawirka la dhaxlay - beddel','Cover'=>'Dabool','Contain'=>'Hayso','Original size'=>'Cabbirka asalka ah','Repeat'=>'Ku celi','No repeat'=>'Laba jibaar ma jiro','Tile'=>'Tile','Tile across'=>'Ku faafi taayirrada','Tile down'=>'So jiif','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Go\'an markii la rogayo','Solid'=>'Adag','Dashed'=>'Dhammaad xariiq ah','Dotted'=>'Dhibco leh','Double'=>'Laban laablaab','Each side separately'=>'Dhinac kasta si gooni ah','Side'=>'Dhanka','Add a shadow'=>'Ku dar hoos-had','Horizontal'=>'Jiifto','Vertical'=>'Toosan','Blur'=>'Cigaal ka dhig','Spread'=>'Faafin','Inside'=>'Gudaha','Remove this shadow'=>'Ka saar hoos-kaalkan','Opacity'=>'Daah-furnaansho','Transform'=>'Beddel','Shadow'=>'Hadhka','Ease'=>'Sahlanaan','Linear'=>'Toosan','Ease in'=>'Fududee','Ease out'=>'Fududee','Ease in and out'=>'Si tartiib ah u gal oo uga bax','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Muddada (milibiri)','What animates'=>'Maxaa kiciya','Easing'=>'Fududeynta','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Daahinta (millisekanntada)','Remove the preset'=>'Ka saar h