ebM video'=>'Dooro MP4 ama WebM video','MP4 address'=>'Cinwaanka MP4','WebM address'=>'Cinwaanka WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Aqoonsiga fiidiyowga YouTube (11 xaraf)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambarka fiidiyowga ee Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Booqdayaashu waxay la xiriiraan adeegga fiidiyowga oo keliya marka ay u dhaadhacaan qaybtan, waligoodna marka qalabkoodu codsado dhaqdhaqaaq yar. Ilaa inta ka horreysa waxay arkaan sawirka boodhka.','Replace poster image'=>'Bedel sawirka boodhka ah','Choose poster image'=>'Dooro sawirka boodhka','Background slideshow'=>'Sawirka asalka ee shaashadda','Change images'=>'Beddel sawirrada','Choose at least two images.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan laba sawir.','Seconds per image'=>'Ilbiriqsikiiba sawirkiiba','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Soodhaawayn tartiib ah (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Ka saar bandhigga bogagga','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Booqdayaasha qalabkoodu codsado dhaqdhaqaaq yar waxay arkaan sawirka koowaad oo keliya.','Section effects'=>'Saamaynta qaybta','Top divider'=>'Kala-bixiyaha sare','Bottom divider'=>'Qeybiyaha hoose','Choose the logo'=>'Dooro calaamadda shirkadda','Not set'=>'Lama dejin','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Hubi midabada sumcadda: mid kasta waxay u baahan tahay magac gaar ah iyo midab sax ah.','Brand name'=>'Magaca sumadda','A logo is chosen.'=>'Logo waa la doortay.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Ka dooro astaanta (logo) bogga naqshadeynta bogga.','Brand colours'=>'Midabada sumadda','Brand %d'=>'Summad %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ku dar midabka summada','Heading font'=>'Farta Madaxa','Body font'=>'Farta jidhka','Tone of voice'=>'Codka hadalka','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Sida uu summadaadu u qoro, tusaale ahaan "Saaxiibtinimo iyo mid fudud, jumlooyin gaaban, erayo farsamo oo aan jirin." AI-gu wuxuu raacayaa mar kasta oo uu u qoro boggan.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Qalabka summada waa la keydiyay.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Summaddu waa la adeegsaday: midabkeeda, farta ay isticmaasho iyo astaanta ayaa hadda ah kuwa bogga.','Apply to site'=>'Go mari bogta','All classes'=>'Dhammaan fasallada','Class name on the page'=>'Magaca fasalka ee bogga ku yaal','Printed as %s.'=>'Loo daabacay sida %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Ka billow xaraf; xarafaha yaryar, tirooyinka iyo xaqiijinta keliya.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Kontaroolada qaabku ma rarna. Dib u rar bogga; haddii ay tani sii jirto, dib u rakib furaha (plugin).','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Fasalka waa la keydiyay. Qayb kasta oo adeegsata waxay leedahay qaabka cusub.','Save class'=>'Keydi fasalka','Class created.'=>'Fasal la abuuray.','New class'=>'Fasalka cusub','e.g. Card'=>'t.a. Kaar','Create'=>'Abuur','Search classes'=>'Fii fasallada','No class matches.'=>'Ma jiro fasal la mid ah.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Weli ma jiraan fasallo. Abuur mid, qaabee, kadibna ku dar walxo kasta oo ka mid ah goobaha uu ka kooban yahay.','Edit %s'=>'Wax ka beddel %s','Class duplicated.'=>'Fasalka waa la guuriyeeyay.','Delete %s'=>'Tirtir %s','Class deleted.'=>'Fasalka waa la tirtiray.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Ma tirtaa fasalka "%s"? Cunsurrada isticmaala waxay x giữaynayaan nuxurkooda waxayna waayayaan qaabkooda.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Kaliya isticmaaleyaasha ku darsan kara HTML aan la sifeyn ayaa bedeli kara CSS-ka gaarka ah.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Qaar ka mid ah CSS-kan lama isticmaali doono: @import, expression(), URL-yada javascript:, "<" iyo xidmooyinka aan dheellitirnayn waa la saaraa sababo ammaan awgood.','Upload a font'=>'Sooji farta','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Font-عارiska kor loogu qaado waxay u baahan tahay WordPress 6.5 ama ka dib.','Font name'=>'Magaca farshaxanka','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'t.A. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s waa la soo geliyay waana diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Dooro faylka far-qoraalka (%s)','Font library'=>'Maktabadda farta','%d files'=>'%d faylal','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Farriinta qoraalka waa la damiyay boggan.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Farta waxaa loo daabacay bogga.','Switch off'=>'Zim/Bixi','Switch on'=>'Daari','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Geli aqoonsiga qalabka (kit id) ee mashruucaaga shabakadda ee Adobe Fonts. Fartaheeda ayaa markaas laga soo rari doonaa Adobe si ay ugu shaqeeyaan bogaggaaga.','Your web projects'=>'Mashruucyadaada shabakadda','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts waa la xirxiray.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts waa la gooyay.','Kit id'=>'Aqoonsiga qalabka','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Qiimaha madoobaadka ee "%s" ma ahan midab sax ah.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Markii boqshoode uusan dooran','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Raac qalabka booqashada','Dark colours'=>'Midabada madow','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Midab kasta sii nooca madow ah. Midabada bannaanaanaya sidooda ayay ku sii sugnaanayaan labada nidaamba. Habka madow wuu shaqaynayaa isla markaana hal midab uu leeyahay qiime madow ah.','Dark version of %s'=>'Nooca madow ee %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'Habka madow waa la keydiyay.','Page CSS'=>'Bogga CSS','Global classes'=>'Fasallada caalamiga ah','Classes'=>'Fasalada','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Abuur fasallada ku jira Naqshadeynta bogga, kadibna halkan ku dar.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS-ga Gaarka ah','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'U qor sharciyo shaygan. "selector" waxay ka dhigan tahay shaygan, tusaale ahaan selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — caddaymaha fudud waxay khuseeyaan shayga laftiisa.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Faylasha xarfaha waa inay noqdaan %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Fayisha faraanku waa madhan tahay ama way ka weyn tahay 10 MB.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Hal mar qaabee, meel walba dib u isticmaal, hal meelna ka beddel.','Variables'=>'Doorsoomayaasha','Named values any element can use.'=>'Qiimayaasha magaca leh ee curiye kastaa isticmaali karo.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Meel-bannaanka, raajitada iyo hoos-kaalmaha','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Cabbiraadyada uu bixiyo ikhtiyaar kasta oo ah meelaha bannaan, geesaha, iyo hooska.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Midabadaada nooc madow ah, oo loogu talagalay booqdayaasha doonaya.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Logo, midabada, farqadaha iyo qaabka codka, ee ay isticmaasho AI iyo qaab-dhismeedyada.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'So geli fartaada gaarka ah ama ku xidh Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS boggan kaliya.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS-ka boggan','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Boggan oo keliya ayaa lagu raray, ka dib qaababka mareegaha. Waxaa lagu keydiyay bogga.','Short name'=>'Magaca gaaban','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Magaca gaaban ee "%s" waxaa loo isticmaalay laba jeer.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": magacyada gaagaaban waxay isticmaalaan xarfo yaryar, tirooyin iyo xarriijimo.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Qiimaha "%s" ma aha mid ay dejimtani aqbasho.','Radius'=>'Shucaaca','Add a step'=>'Ku dar tallaabo','Scales saved.'=>'Miisaankii waa la kaydiyay.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Miisaanku wuxuu ku noqday sidii hore.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Dib ugu deji miisaannada caadiga ah','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Weli ma jiraan doorsoomayaal. Doorsoomuhu wuxuu hayaa hal qiime — ballac, isku-darka midabka, cabbirka farshaxanka — oo ay wadaagaan curiyeyaal badani.','Add variable'=>'Ku dar doorsoome','Variables saved.'=>'Dhinacyada waa la keydiyay.','Entrance animation'=>'Hordhaca animations-ka','Fade in'=>'Soo bandhigid tartiib ah','Fade in, rising'=>'Qaybo soo baxaya, kor u kacaya','Fade in, dropping'=>'Dhex-muuqasho, hoos u dhacaya','Fade in from the start side'=>'Ka soo dhex muuqo dhinaca bilowga','Fade in from the end side'=>'Ka soo muuqasho jilicsan dhinaca dhammaadka','Zoom out'=>'Soodhaji','Flip up'=>'Beddel sare','Animation length (ms)'=>'Dhererka animation-ka (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Dib u dhaca animation-ka (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Inta aad qabanayso rogashada','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Midab u beddel sida ay shaashadda ugu soo muuqato','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Kor u kac markay soo muuqato inta la rogayo','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Kor u kaca marka uu soo muuqdo adiga oo rogaya','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Toos marka uu aragga soo galo','On hover'=>'Mark marka la dul saaro','Lift'=>'Qaado','Glow'=>'Glow','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Sii wad aragtida (px laga bilaabo xagga sare)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Xawaaraha Parallax (-10 ilaa 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Raac tilmaamaha (xoogga)','Place ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Goobta','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Ku hel Google Place ID finder: raadi ganacsigaaga oo koobiyeey ID-ga.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Furaha ya API kutoka kwa mradi wako wa Google Cloud ambayo ina huduma ya Places API (New) imewashwa. Izuie kwa API hiyo pekee.','Business unit ID'=>'Aqoonsiga unugga ganacsiga','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Aqoonsiga 24-xaraf ah ee ganacsigaaga ee ku yaal Trustpilot, kana yimid akoonkaaga Ganacsiga ee Trustpilot (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Furaha API ee akoonkaaga Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Lama dejinin.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la kaydiyey lama akhrin karo endaa (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Geli mar kale.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay aqoonsi iyo furaha API labadaba.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Habay. Dib-u-eegisyada Google waxaa lala soo dhex galaa toos marka kasta oo la eego bog leh baloogga Dib-u-eegisyada: hal codsi oo Place Details ah oo ku saabsan furahaaga ee aragti kasta, waligeedna ma kaydsanaado (shuruudaha Google uma oggolaanayaan in la hayo).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Dib-u-cuskii ugu horreeyay wuu guuldarraystay: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Loo sugayo cusboonaysiintii ugu horreysay (hal ama laba daqiiqo gudahood).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'La cusboonaysiiyay %1$s: %2$d faallooyin waa la haystay, lagu qiimeeyay %3$s taas oo laga soo qaatay %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Isku daygii ugu dambeeyay, %1$s, wuu guuldarraystay waxaana la hayay dib u eegisyada kor ku xusan: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Kaydsan. Faallooyinka Trustpilot waxaa dibadda looga soo qaadaa daqiiqad ama laba gudaheed; faallooyinka Google si toos ah ayay bogga uga soo baxaan.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Dib-e-eegisyada Trustpilot waxaa la soo qaadaa hal mar maalintii iyadoo gadaal laga shaqeynayo laguna hayo boggaaga, markaa bog mashquul badan lacag dheeraad ah kuma karsado akoonkaaga Trustpilot; haddii dib-u-cusboonaysiintu guuldarraysato, dib-e-eegisyadii ugu dambeeyay waa ay sii jiraan. Google ma oggola in dib-e-eegisyadiisa la keydiyo, markaa waxaa si toos ah loo soo shubaa marka uu soo booqde eego bogga: booqasho kasta waa hal codsi oo ku saabsan furahaaga Google, kaas oo uu Google lacag ka qaadayo.','Where to find it'=>'Halkee laga helaa','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'La kaydiyay (…%s). Qor mid cusub si aad u beddesho.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Ka saar tafaasiisha %s iyo faallooyinkeeda','Refreshed.'=>'Cusboonaysii.','Refresh now'=>'Dib u cusbooneysii hadda','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Cusboonaysiiyaha maalinlaha ah ee xiga: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Fahfaahintaada Google iyo Trustpilot, oo loogu talagalay qaybta Faallooyinka.','No colours yet.'=>'Midabada weli ma jiraan.','Colour %d'=>'Midab %d','Add colour'=>'Midab ku dar','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Laba midab ayaa leh magac isku mid ah. Dib u magacow mid ka mid ah.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ma aha midab sax ah.','Theme colours'=>'Midabada mawduuca','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Midabada dulucdaada. Isbeddelka halkan lagu sameeyo waxaa loo keydiyaa sidii nuqulka boggaaga ee midabka, si la mid ah sida Tafatiraha Boggu u keydiyo, wuxuuna ka shaqeeyaa meel kasta oo midabka la isticmaalo.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Midabada mawduucu waxay ku noqdeen qiyamkoodii asalka ahaa ee mawduuca.','Reset theme colours'=>'Dib u deji midabada mowduuca','Your colours'=>'Midabadaada','Colours saved.'=>'Midabada waa la keydiyay.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Dooro midab loogu talagalay %s','Clear'=>'Nadiifi','The change could not be saved.'=>'Isbeddelka lama kaydin karo.','Theme default'=>'Mawduuca caadiga ah','Theme fonts'=>'Fanka Mawduuca','Your fonts'=>'Font-yadaada','Font stack'=>'Habka farta','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Farta la soo geliyay: faylalkeedu waxay ka yimaadaan maktabadda farta.','System sans-serif'=>'Nidaamka sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ku dar font stack','Fonts saved.'=>'Fartyeedyada waa la keydiyay.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Mowduucaaga iyo Tafatiraha Goobta ayaa la wadaagay.','Fonts'=>'Faruuraha','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Faracyada madaxa iyo jidhka ee degelka oo dhan.','Back to Site design'=>'Ku noqo Naqshadda mareegta','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Fasallada, calaamadaha, habka madow, xirmada astaanta iyo farshaxannada gaarka ah waxay la yimaadaan Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Fur qaababka Tafatiraha Mareegta','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Madax leh dherer xariiq oo adag, oo lagu habeeyey tabka Style.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Sadqof qoraal ah, oo lagu qaabeeyey tabka Style.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Sawir geesal wareegsan leh, oo lagu habeeyay tabka Habka.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Muuqaal ka socda Maktabadda Warbaahinta, oo lagu qurxiyay tabka Qaabka.','Spacer'=>'Banaan-sameeye','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Meel madhan oo u dhexeysa baloogyada; ku deji dherer kala duwan shaashad kasta oo ku taal tabka Qaabka (Style).','Divider'=>'Kaburow','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Khad jiif ah oo u dhexeeya qaybaha, oo lagu habeeyey tabka Style.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Ku dar waxyaabo ka yimid goob kale (muuqaal, qoraal, khariidad) adigoo soo dhejinaya ciwaankeeda.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Sawirro dhowr ah oo ku jira shabakad, oo lagu habeeyey tabta Qaabka.','Plain'=>'Caadi','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ma jiraan luuqado la isku beddelayo. Beddeluhu wuxuu soo baxayaa marka qalabka turjumaaddu uu liis gareeyo laba ama in ka badan oo luuqadood.','Switcher'=>'Beddeleeyaha','Show the current language'=>'Muuji luqadda hadda taagan','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku rakib Tranzly oo liis garee laba luqadood ama ka badan, isla markaana badalku wuxuu ka muuqanayaa halkan.','Pills'=>'Kiniiniyada','Dropdown'=>'Hoos-u-dhac','Language codes'=>'Codes-ka luqadaha','Show each language as'=>'Muuji luqad kasta sida','Language name'=>'Magaca luqadda','Language code'=>'Qaabka luqadda','Name and code'=>'Magaca iyo koodka','Flags'=>'Calaamadaha','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Demaysan: calanka waa waddan, ee ma aha luqad.','Include the current language'=>'Ku dar luuqadda hadda jirta','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Qari luqadaha aan boggan lagu tarjumin','Stack vertically'=>'Isku xidh toosan','Current language text'=>'Luqadda hadda taagan','Current language background'=>'Asalka luqadda ee hadda jira','Size and spacing'=>'Cabbirka iyo kala fogaanshaha','Space between languages'=>'Luqadaha u dhexeeya','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Connected (key %s).'=>'Ku xidhan (furaha %s).','API URL'=>'API URL','Replace the API key'=>'Beddelfuraha API-ga','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Halkee laga helaa furahaaga API ee %s','Check and save'=>'Hubi oo keydi','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Hal mar ku xidh adeegga liiska boostada; kadibna foom kasta wuxuu ku dari karaa dadka buuxiya mid ka mid ah liisaskaaga (goobaha baloogga foomka → Kadib dirista). Furayaasha waxaa lagu hubiyaa adeegga, waxaa si sir ah loogu kaydiyaa boggan oo waligood mar dambe lama tuso.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'U dir soo gudbinta foomamka iyo gujisyada badhamada falanqayntaada adigoo aan qorin wax kood ah. Ka tag aqoonsi madhan si aad uga tagto adeeggaas. Badhamada waxay ka helaan beerta "dhacdada Beddelka" guddigooda Sare. Iyadoo boodhka buskudka uu shaqaynayo, waxba ma soo dejisanayaan ilaa booqdayaalgu ay oggolaadaan.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Google Analytics 4 cabiraadda ID-ga','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Google Tag Manager koodka aqoonsiga ee weelka','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID (lambarka ka muuqda Maareeyaha Dhacdooyinka Meta)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Ku shub calaamadahan boggayga internetka','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Demi haddii mawduucaagu ama qalab kale oo dheeraad ah uu horay u daray; dhacdooyinka weli waa la dirayaa.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Magaca dhacdada ee gudbinta foomka','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Bannalku waa popup aad adigu ku naqshadaysay baloogno. Badhannadiisu waxay ku xidhan yihiin #consent-accept, #consent-reject iyo #consent-save (oo wata sanduuqyo calaamadin ah oo loo magacaabay falanqaynta iyo suuqgeynta "save"); xiriirinta #consent-open meel kasta oo ay tahay waxay muujinaysaa mar kale. Ilaa inta booqashadu ay aqbalayso, calaamadaha dabagalka ma soo raranayaan, Google Consent Mode wuxuu ahaadaa "denied", qoraallada aad liis garaysayna waxay ahaadaan kuwa damisan.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Abuur boodhadh diyaarsan','Show a cookie banner'=>'Muuji boodhadhka buskudka','Banner'=>'Banner','Choose a popup…'=>'Dooro pop-up…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (qoraal-gacmeed)','Edit the banner'=>'Wax ka beddel astaanta','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Xusuusnow doorashada (days)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Midowga Yurub, EEA iyo UK ka baxsan: rarka raadraaca ilaa inta booqdaha uu ka diidayo','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Dami: waa inay kasta oo soo booqadaa ogolaadaa marka hore (xeerka ugu adag, waana kan caadiga ah). Daaran: kaliya marka martigeliyahaagu ama CDN-kaagu uu soo sheego dalka uu ka soo jeedo soo-booqdaha (tusaale ahaan madaxa Cloudflare ee CF-IPCountry) oo uu ka baxsan yahay EU, EEA, UK iyo Switzerland. Bannanka ayaa weli la tusayaa, dalkuna aan la aqoon waxaa loola dhaqmaa sida mid ka dhex jira EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Qoraallo kale oo la haayo illaa laga helayo oggolaanshaha (maareeyaha:analytics ama maareeyaha:marketing, oo ay kala soocayaan hakadyo)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Daaqadaha soo booda, kuwa simbiriirixda ah iyo baararka','A/B test results'=>'Natiijada tijaabada A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Hagayaal: foomamka, daaqadaha soo booda, dhaqaaqa, raadraaca, imtixaannada A/B iyo bannalka buskudka','Mailing-list connections'=>'Xiriiriyeyaasha liiska boostada','Popup settings'=>'Dejinta bood-boodka','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'So baxaya (bartamaha, bogga oo madow)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Gelin-geliye (gees ku yaal)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Bar (korka ama hoose)','Bottom, end side'=>'Hoose, dhinaca dhammaadka','Bottom, start side'=>'Hoose, dhinaca billowga','When the page loads'=>'Markuu boggu soo rarnaado','After a delay'=>'Dib u dhac kadib','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Ka dib markaad hoos u rogto qayb ka mid ah bogga','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Markuu booqdaha ku sigowsto inuu tago','When something is clicked'=>'Markaa wax la gujiyo','Percent of the page'=>'Boqolleyda bogga','CSS selector of the element'=>'Xulaha CSS ee curiyaha','How often'=>'Imisa jeer','Every page view'=>'Aragti kasta oo bog ah','Once per visit'=>'Hal mar boo booasho kasta','Once every few days'=>'Mararka qaar dhowrkii maalmood kasta','Until the visitor converts'=>'Ilaa inta uu booqashada badalayo','Every page'=>'Bog kasta','The front page'=>'Bogga hore','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Bogocyada la doortay (ID-yada)','Chosen content types'=>'Noocyada nuxurka ee la doortay','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'Aqoonsiyeyaasha bogagga, oo lagu kala saaray hakad','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Noocyada nuxurka, oo ay kala sooceen hakad (qoraal, bog, badeeco)','Devices'=>'Qalabka','Desktop only'=>'Desktop keliya','Mobile only'=>'Kaliya mobilka','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Xir marka bogga madow la gujiyo','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Ku xidh badhan #popup-close si aad u xidho popup-ka, ama #popup-convert si aad u tirsato beddelka.','Conversion event'=>'Dhacdada beddelka','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'Markaa tan la gujiyo waxaa loo diraa xogtaada falanqaynta (tusaale ahaan sign_up). Adeegyada ka yeel Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'Wakaaladaha AI waa la oggol yahay. Dib u soo rar boggan si aad u aragto qalabka.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Wakaaladaha AI waa la damiyay. Cinwaankooda xiriirku mar dambe ma jawaabayo.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s sido kale waa ay/uu wax ka bedelayaa boggan. Keydintu waxayna tirtiri kartaa isbeddelladooda.','Block library'=>'Maktabadda xannibaadda','Layers'=>'Lakabado','Page canvas'=>'Bogga fanka','Revisions'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada','Block settings'=>'Dejinta xannibaadda','Add block: %s'=>'Kudar baloog: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ka fur Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Ka noqo','Redo'=>'Dib u samee','Show or hide layers'=>'Muuji ama qari lakabyada','Show or hide the block library'=>'Muuji ama qari maktabadda baloogga','Show revisions'=>'Muuji dib-u-eegisyada','Open the normal editor'=>'Fur tafatiraha caadiga ah','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gaaban-gaabyada kiiboodhka','Preview: desktop'=>'Horay u eeg: desktop-ka','Preview: tablet'=>'Horudhaca: tablet','Preview: mobile'=>'Horay u eeg: moobilka','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Nuqul ka qaado qaabka baloogga la doortay','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Qaabka ku dheji xannibaadda la doortay','Copy the selected section'=>'Koobi qaybta la xushay','Paste a copied section'=>'Geli qayb la koobiyay','Turn off safe mode'=>'Dam modo amaanka','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Daar habka nabdoon (plugins-ka kale waa dansan yihiin, adiga awgeed, Studio kaliya)','Scheduled'=>'Qorsheysan','Pending review'=>'Waxa la sugayaa dib u eegis','Private'=>'Gaar loo leeyahay','Draft'=>'Qabyo','All changes saved'=>'Dhammaan isbeddellada waa la kaydiyay','Saving…'=>'Kaydinaya…','Autosaving…'=>'Kaydinaya…','Unsaved changes'=>'Isbeddellada aan la kaydin','autosaved'=>'si toos ah loo keydiyey','Desktop preview'=>'Horudhaca desktop-ka','Tablet preview'=>'Horudhaca Kiniinka','Mobile preview'=>'Horudhaca mobaayilka','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'%1$s horudhac (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Qalabka Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Ku noqo tafatiraha caadiga ah','Page title'=>'Cinwaanka bogga','Preview width'=>'Ballaca horudhaca','Command palette'=>'Baakadaha amarka','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Daawado bogga (waxaa lagu furayaa tab cusub)','Save draft'=>'Kaydi qabyada','Publish'=>'Daabac','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad soo celiso isbeddellada aan la kaydin?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Boggan wuxuu leeyahay isbeddello aan weligood la keydin. Waxaa lagu hayay biraawsarkan:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Boggan wuxuu leeyahay keydin cusub oo si otomaatig ah loo sameeyay marka loo eego nooca la keydiyay:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Soceli isbeddellada aan la keydinin','Discard'=>'Basaal','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada lama soo dejin karo.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Dib-u-eegistii waa la soo celiyay. Kaydi si aad u hayso, ama ka noqo si aad dib ugu noqoto.','Close revisions'=>'Xir wax-ka-beddellada','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Weli wax dib u eegis ah ma jiraan. Kaydin kastaa waxay samaysaa mid.','Revision from %s'=>'Dib-u-eegistii laga bilaabo %s','Restore this revision'=>'Soceli dib u eegistan','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Habka badbaadada lama beddeli karin.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Habka badbaadada waa shidhan yahay.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%dplugin kale ayaa dansan, adiga iyo Sandwich Studio keliya. Bogga tooska ah iyo isticmaaleyaasha kale ma saameyn doono.' . "\0" . '%d plugins kale waa la damiyay, adiga iyo Sandwich Studio keliya. Bogga tooska ah iyo isticmaaleyaasha kale ma saameynayo.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Habka nabdoon: dami furayaasha kale ee Studio, adiga keligaa','Save as pattern'=>'U kaydi sida qaab ahaan','Synced'=>'Isku-dubbaray','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Haddhowa loo beddelo qaab-dhismeedka waxay ka beddeshaa meel kasta oo la isticmaalo.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Nuqul kasta waxaa loo tiri karaa si gaar ah.','Save your changes.'=>'Keydi isbeddelladaada.','Undo your last change.'=>'Ka noqo isbeddelkaagii ugu dambeeyay.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Ku celi wixii aad ugu dambaysay ee aad dib u celisay.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Muuji ama qari guddiga lakabyada.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Muuji gaaban-yada kiiboodhkan.','Select a block first.'=>'Markuu hore u dooro baloog.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Qaabka waa la guuriyay. Ku dheji baloog kasta, boggan ama mid kale.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Barawarku wuu diiday inuu guuriyo.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Qeybta waa la koobiyay. Ku dhaji bog kasta, oo ku yaal boggan ama mid kale.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Sabxadda goyntu ma hayso qaab laga soo guuriyay Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Qaabka lagu dhejiyay %d baloog.' . "\0" . 'Qaabka waxaa lagu dhejiyay %d baloog.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Habkaas kuma habboona xannibaadda la xulay.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Looxa qoraalka ayaa wada haynin qayb la koobiyay.','Section pasted.'=>'Qaybta la keenay.','Paste style'=>'Ku dhaji qaabka','Paste section'=>'Qeybta dhaji','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Riix Ctrl+V (ama Cmd+V oo ku taal Mac) halkan si aad u dhajiso','Copy style'=>'Nuqulka qaabka','Copy section'=>'Nuqul ka qaado qaybta','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku Tasi Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Kaydintu waa guuldarraystay. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga oo dib isku day; isbeddeladaadu waxay ku jiraan biraawsarkan.','Published.'=>'La daabacay.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Dayactirka iyo qaabka ka horreeya daah-furka','What visitors see'=>'Waxa ay booqdayasha arkaan','The site, as normal'=>'Goobtu, sidii caadiga ahayd','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Dayactir: ogeysiis, waxaana mashiinnada raadinta la faray inay soo noqdaan hadhow','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Daah-furka ka hor: ogeysiis, waxaana mashiinnada raadinta la farayaa inaysan tusin goobta','Page to show instead'=>'Bogga lagu soo bandhigo halkii','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Ku naqshadee bogag kasta dhisaha oo halkaan ka dooro. Adigoon midna haysan, booqashadayaashu waxay arkayaan ogeysiis gaaban oo wata magaca mareegta.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Yaa weli arka bogga dhabta ah (maamulayaashu mar walba way arkaan):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Daaraha shabakadda daaqad gaar ah si aad u aragto waxa ay booqdayaashu arkaan.','Network settings saved.'=>'Dejinta shabakadda waa la kaydiyay.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Dejintlahan waxaa lagu dabaqayaa %d goob ee shabakaddan.' . "\0" . 'Dejintlahan waxaa lagu dabaqayaa %d goobood ee shabakaddan.','Shared templates'=>'Muunado la wadaago','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Noocyada la kaydiyay ee ku yaalla bogga ugu weyn ee halkan lagu calaamadiyay waxay ka muuqdaan bog kasta, oo hoos yimaada "Shabakadda qaababka". Bog kastaa wuxuu geliyaa nuqulkiisa.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Bogga wejigu ma laha qaabab la keydiyay weli.','White label for every site'=>'Sumad cad oo loogu talagalay bog kasta','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Waxaa isticmaala bog kasta oo aan keydin habayntiisa calaamadda-cad.','Turn white label on'=>'Daar astaanta cad','Builder name'=>'Magaca dhisaha','Visual editor name'=>'Magaca tifaftiraha muuqaalka','Author website'=>'Bogga qoraaga','Menu icon'=>'Astaanta liiska','Role defaults for every site'=>'Doorka caadiga ah ee bog kasta','Save network settings'=>'Keydi habaynta shabakadda','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Raadinaya... %d shay ayaa la hubiyay ilaa hadda.' . "\0" . 'Raadinaya… %d shay ayaa la eegay ilaa hadda.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Lama helin wax natiijo ah oo ku jirta %d shey. Ma jiro wax la beddelayo.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'%1$d ee kulan ee ku yaal bogagga %2$d (%3$d alaab ayaa la raadiyay). Waxba weli isma beddelin.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Bedelayaa… %1$d oo ka mid ah %2$d bogag waa la dhammeeyay.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'La dhammeeyey: %d bogol ayaa is beddelay. Waad ka noqon kartaa tan.' . "\0" . 'La dhammeeyey: %d bogag ayaa la beddelay. Waad ka noqon kartaa tan.','Undoing…'=>'Dib u celinaya…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'La laalay: %1$d bogol ayaa la soo celiyay. %2$d bog ayaa la tafatiray beddelka ka dib waxaana lagu reebay sidadooda.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'Waa la beddelay: %d bogag ayaa dib loo soo celiyay.' . "\0" . 'Waa la nooleeyay: %d bogag.','Replace'=>'Beddel','Find'=>'Raadi','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Midab hex ah sida #1a73e8. Qaababka gaagaaban (#fff) sidoo kale waa la helayaa.','Replace with'=>'Bedel oo ku beddel','Match upper and lower case'=>'U dhigma xarafka weyn iyo kan yar','Find matches'=>'Helo raadso','Matches'=>'Mid ayaa la helay','Replace on %d page'=>'Ku beddel bogagga %d' . "\0" . 'Ku beddel %d bogag','Undo this replacement'=>'Ka noqo beddeliddaan','Review comments'=>'Faallooyinka dib-u-eegista','Add a comment'=>'Ku dar faallo','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Faallo %1$d oo uu qoray %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Faallooyin %d ah oo ku yaalla boggan.','Your comment'=>'Faalladaada','Send comment'=>'Dir faallo','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Mahadsanid, faallooyinkaaga waa la diray.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Guji qaybta bogga ee uu faallooyinkaagu ku saabsan yahay.','Client review'=>'Dib u eegista macaamiisha','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'Qaybtan bogga waa la waayay: waxaa laga yaabaa in la beddelay ama la tirtiray tan iyo markii faallooyinka la sameeyay.','Review link'=>'Dib u eeg xiriirka','Let a client comment on this page'=>'U oggloow macmiil inuu faallo ka bixiyo boggan','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'Qof kasta oo leh xiriiriyaha wuxuu arki karaa boggan, xitaa ka hor intaan la daabacin, wuxuuna ka tagi karaa faallooyin. Kooto looma baahna.','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'Samee xiriiriye cusub (midkii hore wuu shaqeynta joojinayaa)','Comments (%d open)'=>'Faallooyin (%dfuran)' . "\0" . 'Faallooyin (%dfuran)','Show resolved comments'=>'Muuji faallooyinka la xalliyay','No comments to show.'=>'Ma jiraan faallooyin la soo bandhigo.','Reply'=>'Ka jawaab','Send reply'=>'Dir jawaabta','Show in the editor'=>'Ka muuji tifaftiraha','Resolve'=>'Xallinta','Reopen'=>'Dib u fur','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'Fur Sandwich Studio','Change styles'=>'Beddel qaababka','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'CSS iyo HTML-ka gaarka ah','Manage templates'=>'Maaree qaababka','Use AI'=>'Adeegso AI','Client mode: text and images only'=>'Habka macmiilka: qoraal iyo sawirro keliya','Role settings saved.'=>'Dejinta doorka waa la keydiyay.','Roles and client mode'=>'Doorka iyo habka macaamiisha','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'Dooro waxa uu doorka walba ka qaban karo dhisaha. Maamulayaashu mar walba wax walba way qaban karaan. Habka macmiilka ayaa xira qaab-dhismeedka iyo naqshadeynta, si uu doorku u beddeli karo oo keliya qoraalka iyo sawirrada.','Save role settings'=>'Kaydi goobaha doorashada','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'La keydiyay. Dib u rár bogagga si aad u aragto magacyada cusub.','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Dib u magacow dhisaha oo qari summadayada bishan','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'Magaca badeecaddu wuxuu ka muuqdaa meel kasta: menu-yada, tifaftiraha, ogeysiisyada.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Ku dhaaf madhan si aad u isticmaasho magaca dhisaha.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Sharaxaadda ku taal shaashadda Plugins','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Magaca Dashicons (tusaale ahaan dashicons-admin-customizer) ama ciwaanka sawirka ee https://.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Ka qari qalabka shaashadda Plugins-ka','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Isticmaalayaasha wakiilada ah ee weli arka badeecada dhabta ah iyo dejisyadan','%d new'=>'%d cusub' . "\0" . '%d cusub','%d replaced'=>'%d la beddelay' . "\0" . '%d la beddelay','%d kept as they were'=>'%d sidii looga tagay' . "\0" . '%d sidii looga tagay','%d setting'=>'%d Dejinta' . "\0" . '%d goobaha','Importing will give: %s.'=>'So dejinta waxay keeni doontaa: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'La soo dejiyay: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'Waxaa la dhoofiyay %d shay.' . "\0" . 'Waxaa la dhoofiyay %d shay.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Feylkaas looma akhriyi karo fayl dhoofin ah.','Export'=>'Dhoofin','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Soo deji qaababkaaga, qaababka naqshadeynta, iyo naqshadeynta mareegahaaga hal fayl ahaan, si aad ugu soo dejiso mareeg kale.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Ma jiraan wax shabakadaha ama qaababka ah ee la dhoofiyo weli.','Include the settings'=>'Ku dar goobaha','Download the export file'=>'Soo deji faylka dhoofinta','Choose an export file'=>'Xullo fayl dhoofin ah','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Faylku wuxuu hayaa %1$d shay oo ka yimid %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Faylku wuxuu hayaa %1$d shay oo ka yimid %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Markii shay ay isku magac yihiin uu horey uga jiro halkaan','Keep the one on this site'=>'Hayso midka kan ku yaal baddan','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Ku beddel kan la soo dhoofiyay','Import a copy beside it'=>'Soo deji nuqul ku xiga','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Dableyda ku isticmaal faylka','Copy the images into this